    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-3-ss-7a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3(7A) Interpretation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-3-ss-7a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "(7A) For the purposes of this Act, a corresponding State law imposes a\nduty on a Commonwealth officer or Commonwealth authority if:\n(a) the corresponding State law confers a function or power on\nthe officer or authority; and\n(b) the circumstances in which the function or power is\nconferred give rise to an obligation on the officer or authority\nto perform the function or to exercise the power.",
      "skos:definition": "(7A) For the purposes of this Act, a corresponding State law imposes a\nduty on a Commonwealth officer or Commonwealth authority if:\n(a) the corresponding State law confers a function or power on\nthe officer or authority; and\n(b) the circumstances in which the function or power is\nconferred give rise to an obligation on the officer or authority\nto perform the function or to exercise the power.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-3"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-3-ss-7a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-3-ss-7a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dad2a826af5c8026e8470e53d5e0e2cb7b4091c84d99773f2cffbe884f04f139",
      "skos:note": "Imposes a duty on Commonwealth authorities if corresponding State law confers function or power and gives rise to obligation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-3-ss-7a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3(7A) Interpretation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "(7A) For the purposes of this Act, a corresponding State law imposes a\nduty on a Commonwealth officer or Commonwealth authority if:\n(a) the corresponding State law confers a function or power on\nthe officer or authority; and\n(b) the circumstances in which the function or power is\nconferred give rise to an obligation on the officer or authority\nto perform the function or to exercise the power."
    },
    {
