    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-3-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3(8) Interpretation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-3-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "(8) To avoid doubt:\n(a) a reference in this Act to therapeutic goods that are registered\nincludes a reference to a medicine that is provisionally\nregistered; and\n(b) a reference in this Act to the registration of therapeutic goods\nincludes a reference to the provisional registration of a\nmedicine.\nNote:\nSubsection 29(2) deals with the provisional registration of a medicine.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) To avoid doubt:\n(a) a reference in this Act to therapeutic goods that are registered\nincludes a reference to a medicine that is provisionally\nregistered; and\n(b) a reference in this Act to the registration of therapeutic goods\nincludes a reference to the provisional registration of a\nmedicine.\nNote:\nSubsection 29(2) deals with the provisional registration of a medicine.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-3"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-3-ss-8-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "98247abf26c246b884444c5b0e286260062ae4cc252a403f190c49d8b71a0650",
      "skos:note": "Clarifies interpretation of registered therapeutic goods and provisional registration."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-3-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3(8) Interpretation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "(8) To avoid doubt:\n(a) a reference in this Act to therapeutic goods that are registered\nincludes a reference to a medicine that is provisionally\nregistered; and\n(b) a reference in this Act to the registration of therapeutic goods\nincludes a reference to the provisional registration of a\nmedicine.\nNote:\nSubsection 29(2) deals with the provisional registration of a medicine."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-3-ss-8-norm",
