      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.42",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may declare, in writing, that a country specified in\nthe declaration is a member of:\n(a) the European Community; or\n(b) the European Free Trade Association.\n(2) A declaration under subsection (1) must be published in the\nGazette or on the Department’s website.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may declare, in writing, that a country specified in\nthe declaration is a member of:\n(a) the European Community; or\n(b) the European Free Trade Association.\n(2) A declaration under subsection (1) must be published in the\nGazette or on the Department’s website.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
