      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that\nspecified monographs in the British Pharmacopoeia, the European\nPharmacopoeia or the United States Pharmacopeia-National\nFormulary are exempt in relation to specified therapeutic goods for\nthe purposes of paragraph (b), (c) or (d) of the definition of\nstandard in subsection 3(1). The determination applies to those\nmonographs as in force from time to time.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.\nExempting parts of monographs",
