      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 43,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, a\ndetermination under subsection (1) or (2) of this section may make\nprovision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or\nincorporating, with or without modification, any matter contained\nin an instrument or other writing as in force or existing from time\nto time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-3c-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
