      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.44",
      "values:originalText": "This Act binds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth, of each\nof the States, of the Australian Capital Territory and of the\nNorthern Territory, but nothing in this Act renders the Crown\n\nPreliminary  Chapter 1\n\nSection 5A\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nliable to be prosecuted for an offence or to be subject to civil\nproceedings for a contravention of a civil penalty provision.",
      "skos:definition": "This Act binds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth, of each\nof the States, of the Australian Capital Territory and of the\nNorthern Territory, but nothing in this Act renders the Crown\n\nPreliminary  Chapter 1\n\nSection 5A\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nliable to be prosecuted for an offence or to be subject to civil\nproceedings for a contravention of a civil penalty provision.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-5-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-5-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8468cb9f88c3ac4e007082b53259900c7146fff27b7ba4143822c6f7b069a4a0",
      "skos:note": "The Crown is bound by this Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-5-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 Act to bind Crown",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 44,
      "values:originalText": "This Act binds the Crown in right of the Commonwealth, of each\nof the States, of the Australian Capital Territory and of the\nNorthern Territory, but nothing in this Act renders the Crown\n\nPreliminary  Chapter 1\n\nSection 5A\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nliable to be prosecuted for an offence or to be subject to civil\nproceedings for a contravention of a civil penalty provision."
    },
    {
