    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 Operation of Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.45",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This Act (other than Part 4-8A or Part 6-1A) applies to:\n(a) things done by corporations; and\n(b) things done by natural persons or corporations in so far as\nthose things are done:\n(i) in the course of, or in preparation for, trade or\ncommerce between Australia and a place outside\nAustralia, among the States, between a State and a\nTerritory or between 2 Territories; or\n(ii) under a law of the Commonwealth relating to the\nprovision of pharmaceutical or repatriation benefits; or\n(iii) in relation to the Commonwealth or in relation to an\nauthority of the Commonwealth.\nNote:",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This Act (other than Part 4-8A or Part 6-1A) applies to:\n(a) things done by corporations; and\n(b) things done by natural persons or corporations in so far as\nthose things are done:\n(i) in the course of, or in preparation for, trade or\ncommerce between Australia and a place outside\nAustralia, among the States, between a State and a\nTerritory or between 2 Territories; or\n(ii) under a law of the Commonwealth relating to the\nprovision of pharmaceutical or repatriation benefits; or\n(iii) in relation to the Commonwealth or in relation to an\nauthority of the Commonwealth.\nNote:",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-6-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-6-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "952e8645f555289bf5258c873872be3a8c92384012e309f79c40542ee5d3de15",
      "skos:note": "Applicable to corporations and natural persons/corporations in certain trade/commerce contexts."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 Operation of Act",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 45,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This Act (other than Part 4-8A or Part 6-1A) applies to:\n(a) things done by corporations; and\n(b) things done by natural persons or corporations in so far as\nthose things are done:\n(i) in the course of, or in preparation for, trade or\ncommerce between Australia and a place outside\nAustralia, among the States, between a State and a\nTerritory or between 2 Territories; or\n(ii) under a law of the Commonwealth relating to the\nprovision of pharmaceutical or repatriation benefits; or\n(iii) in relation to the Commonwealth or in relation to an\nauthority of the Commonwealth.\nNote:"
    },
