      },
      "cml:operator": "appliesTo",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Applicable to trade/commerce between Australia and a place outside Australia, among the States, between a State and a Territory or between 2 Territories.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(i) in the course of, or in preparation for, trade or commerce between Australia and a place outside Australia, among the States, between a State and a Territory or between 2 Territories;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-6b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6B Review of certain decisions under State laws",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-6b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.50",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Application may be made to the Administrative Review Tribunal\nfor review of a reviewable State decision.\n(2) A decision made by the Secretary in the performance of a function,\nor the exercise of a power, conferred by a corresponding State law\nis a reviewable State decision for the purpose of this section if:\n(a) the law under which the decision was made provides for\nreview by the Administrative Review Tribunal; and\n(b) the decision is declared by the regulations to be a reviewable\ndecision for the purposes of this section.\n\nPreliminary  Chapter 1\n\nSection 6C\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(3) For the purposes of subsection (1), the Administrative Review\nTribunal Act 2024 has effect as if a corresponding State law were\nan Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Application may be made to the Administrative Review Tribunal\nfor review of a reviewable State decision.\n(2) A decision made by the Secretary in the performance of a function,\nor the exercise of a power, conferred by a corresponding State law\nis a reviewable State decision for the purpose of this section if:\n(a) the law under which the decision was made provides for\nreview by the Administrative Review Tribunal; and\n(b) the decision is declared by the regulations to be a reviewable\ndecision for the purposes of this section.\n\nPreliminary  Chapter 1\n\nSection 6C\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(3) For the purposes of subsection (1), the Administrative Review\nTribunal Act 2024 has effect as if a corresponding State law were\nan Act.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-6b-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-6b-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-6b-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b21feef3a4cd825bbaa1dc89e026114991befe1c631521a820ddc3f12e0941fd"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-6b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6B Review of certain decisions under State laws",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 50,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Application may be made to the Administrative Review Tribunal\nfor review of a reviewable State decision.\n(2) A decision made by the Secretary in the performance of a function,\nor the exercise of a power, conferred by a corresponding State law\nis a reviewable State decision for the purpose of this section if:\n(a) the law under which the decision was made provides for\nreview by the Administrative Review Tribunal; and\n(b) the decision is declared by the regulations to be a reviewable\ndecision for the purposes of this section.\n\nPreliminary  Chapter 1\n\nSection 6C\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(3) For the purposes of subsection (1), the Administrative Review\nTribunal Act 2024 has effect as if a corresponding State law were\nan Act."
    },
