      "cml:premiseText": "(2) Before making a determination under subsection (1), the Minister:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-7-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7(2) Declaration that goods are/are not therapeutic goods",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-7-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.51",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Before making a determination under subsection (1), the Minister:\n(a) must have regard to the following matters:\n(i) whether it is likely that the specified goods, if not\nregulated under this Act, might harm the health of\nmembers of the public;\n(ii) whether it is appropriate in all the circumstances to\napply the national system of controls relating to the\nquality, safety, efficacy and performance of therapeutic\ngoods established by this Act to regulate the specified\ngoods;\n(iii) whether the kinds of risks from the specified goods to\nwhich members of the public might be exposed could be\nmore appropriately dealt with under another regulatory\nscheme; and\n(b) may have regard to any other relevant matter.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Before making a determination under subsection (1), the Minister:\n(a) must have regard to the following matters:\n(i) whether it is likely that the specified goods, if not\nregulated under this Act, might harm the health of\nmembers of the public;\n(ii) whether it is appropriate in all the circumstances to\napply the national system of controls relating to the\nquality, safety, efficacy and performance of therapeutic\ngoods established by this Act to regulate the specified\ngoods;\n(iii) whether the kinds of risks from the specified goods to\nwhich members of the public might be exposed could be\nmore appropriately dealt with under another regulatory\nscheme; and\n(b) may have regard to any other relevant matter.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-7"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-7-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-7-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-7-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-7-ss-2-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2fc439d34c27e4c639531f6ed6e4489d5cb149aae973396bb8f7ef9d2e563fb3",
      "skos:note": "Goods are not therapeutic goods under certain conditions. Minister must consider certain matters before making a determination about regulating goods."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-7-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7(2) Declaration that goods are/are not therapeutic goods",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 51,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Before making a determination under subsection (1), the Minister:\n(a) must have regard to the following matters:\n(i) whether it is likely that the specified goods, if not\nregulated under this Act, might harm the health of\nmembers of the public;\n(ii) whether it is appropriate in all the circumstances to\napply the national system of controls relating to the\nquality, safety, efficacy and performance of therapeutic\ngoods established by this Act to regulate the specified\ngoods;\n(iii) whether the kinds of risks from the specified goods to\nwhich members of the public might be exposed could be\nmore appropriately dealt with under another regulatory\nscheme; and\n(b) may have regard to any other relevant matter."
    },
