    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9D(2) Variation of entries in Register",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-9d-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom therapeutic goods are\nregistered or listed has requested the Secretary to vary\ninformation included in the entry in the Register that relates\nto the goods; and\n(b) the only effect of the variation would be:\n(i) to reduce the class of persons for whom the goods are\nsuitable; or\n(ii) to add a warning, or precaution, that does not include\nany comparison of the goods with any other therapeutic\ngoods by reference to quality, safety or efficacy;\nthe Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom therapeutic goods are\nregistered or listed has requested the Secretary to vary\ninformation included in the entry in the Register that relates\nto the goods; and\n(b) the only effect of the variation would be:\n(i) to reduce the class of persons for whom the goods are\nsuitable; or\n(ii) to add a warning, or precaution, that does not include\nany comparison of the goods with any other therapeutic\ngoods by reference to quality, safety or efficacy;\nthe Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a3d17269b40dbe63e3bd653cecdaf2709639d6423e1c74626c440b3e9add4fbd",
      "skos:note": "Variation of entries in Register upon request"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-9d-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9D(2) Variation of entries in Register",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 59,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom therapeutic goods are\nregistered or listed has requested the Secretary to vary\ninformation included in the entry in the Register that relates\nto the goods; and\n(b) the only effect of the variation would be:\n(i) to reduce the class of persons for whom the goods are\nsuitable; or\n(ii) to add a warning, or precaution, that does not include\nany comparison of the goods with any other therapeutic\ngoods by reference to quality, safety or efficacy;\nthe Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request."
    },
