    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9D(3) Variation of entries in Register",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-9d-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom therapeutic goods are\nregistered or listed has requested the Secretary to vary\n\nChapter 2  Australian Register of Therapeutic Goods\n\nSection 9D\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\ninformation included in the entry in the Register that relates\nto the goods; and\n(b) subsection (2) does not apply to the request; and\n(ba) subsection (2C) does not apply to the request; and\n(c) the Secretary is satisfied that the variation requested does not\nindicate any reduction in the quality, safety or efficacy of the\ngoods for the purposes for which they are to be used;\nthe Secretary may vary the entry in accordance with the request.\n(3AA) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom a biological is included in the\nRegister has requested the Secretary to vary information\nincluded in the entry in the Register that relates to the\nbiological; and\n(b) the only effect of the variation would be:\n(i) to reduce the class of persons for whom the biological is\nsuitable; or\n(ii) to add a warning, or precaution, that does not include\nany comparison of the biological with any other\ntherapeutic goods by reference to quality, safety or\nefficacy;\nthe Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request.\n(3AC) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom a biological is included in the\nRegister has requested the Secretary to vary the entry in the\nRegister that relates to the biological; and\n(b) the variation is of a kind specified in the regulations; and\n(c) the conditions (if any) specified in the regulations are\nsatisfied;\nthe Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom therapeutic goods are\nregistered or listed has requested the Secretary to vary\n\nChapter 2  Australian Register of Therapeutic Goods\n\nSection 9D\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\ninformation included in the entry in the Register that relates\nto the goods; and\n(b) subsection (2) does not apply to the request; and\n(ba) subsection (2C) does not apply to the request; and\n(c) the Secretary is satisfied that the variation requested does not\nindicate any reduction in the quality, safety or efficacy of the\ngoods for the purposes for which they are to be used;\nthe Secretary may vary the entry in accordance with the request.\n(3AA) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom a biological is included in the\nRegister has requested the Secretary to vary information\nincluded in the entry in the Register that relates to the\nbiological; and\n(b) the only effect of the variation would be:\n(i) to reduce the class of persons for whom the biological is\nsuitable; or\n(ii) to add a warning, or precaution, that does not include\nany comparison of the biological with any other\ntherapeutic goods by reference to quality, safety or\nefficacy;\nthe Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request.\n(3AC) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom a biological is included in the\nRegister has requested the Secretary to vary the entry in the\nRegister that relates to the biological; and\n(b) the variation is of a kind specified in the regulations; and\n(c) the conditions (if any) specified in the regulations are\nsatisfied;\nthe Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3-logic-linearlogic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3-logic-descriptionlogic-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3-logic-deontic-6"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b32b31452e17103c8ea14d4dfa410bf0bd23e58c8a1dc2ba799d6a91b98c5c52",
      "skos:note": "Secretary may vary entry in Register upon request."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-9d-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9D(3) Variation of entries in Register",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 59,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom therapeutic goods are\nregistered or listed has requested the Secretary to vary\n\nChapter 2  Australian Register of Therapeutic Goods\n\nSection 9D\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\ninformation included in the entry in the Register that relates\nto the goods; and\n(b) subsection (2) does not apply to the request; and\n(ba) subsection (2C) does not apply to the request; and\n(c) the Secretary is satisfied that the variation requested does not\nindicate any reduction in the quality, safety or efficacy of the\ngoods for the purposes for which they are to be used;\nthe Secretary may vary the entry in accordance with the request.\n(3AA) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom a biological is included in the\nRegister has requested the Secretary to vary information\nincluded in the entry in the Register that relates to the\nbiological; and\n(b) the only effect of the variation would be:\n(i) to reduce the class of persons for whom the biological is\nsuitable; or\n(ii) to add a warning, or precaution, that does not include\nany comparison of the biological with any other\ntherapeutic goods by reference to quality, safety or\nefficacy;\nthe Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request.\n(3AC) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom a biological is included in the\nRegister has requested the Secretary to vary the entry in the\nRegister that relates to the biological; and\n(b) the variation is of a kind specified in the regulations; and\n(c) the conditions (if any) specified in the regulations are\nsatisfied;\nthe Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request."
    },
