      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "May",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Permits variation of entries in Register.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9D(3B) Variation of entries in Register",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-9d-ss-3b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "(3B) If:\n(a) a particular biological ceases to be a biological because of a\ndetermination under subsection 32A(3); and\n(b) the biological is included in the Register under Part 3-2A;\nthe Secretary must move the entry relating to the biological from\nthe part of the Register for biologicals to whichever other part of\nthe Register is applicable.",
      "skos:definition": "(3B) If:\n(a) a particular biological ceases to be a biological because of a\ndetermination under subsection 32A(3); and\n(b) the biological is included in the Register under Part 3-2A;\nthe Secretary must move the entry relating to the biological from\nthe part of the Register for biologicals to whichever other part of\nthe Register is applicable.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3b-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b21e1e9da45f15a88d019c656873026c68501ede9c65b35b3758112ea02ddff0",
      "skos:note": "Secretary must move entry from part of Register for biologicals to applicable part."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-9d-ss-3b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9D(3B) Variation of entries in Register",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 59,
      "values:originalText": "(3B) If:\n(a) a particular biological ceases to be a biological because of a\ndetermination under subsection 32A(3); and\n(b) the biological is included in the Register under Part 3-2A;\nthe Secretary must move the entry relating to the biological from\nthe part of the Register for biologicals to whichever other part of\nthe Register is applicable."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3b-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3b"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
