      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3b-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to move entry",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9D(3C) Variation of entries in Register",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-9d-ss-3c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "(3C) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom a kind of medical device is\nincluded in the Register has requested the Secretary to vary\ninformation included in the entry in the Register that relates\nto the kind of medical device; and\n(b) the only effect of the variation would be:\n(i) to reduce the class of persons for whom the kind of\nmedical device is suitable; or\n(ii) to add a warning, restriction or precaution, that does not\ninclude any comparison of the kind of medical device\nwith any other therapeutic goods by reference to quality,\nsafety or performance;\nthe Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request.\n(3CB) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom a kind of medical device is\nincluded in the Register has requested the Secretary to vary\nthe entry in the Register that relates to the kind of medical\ndevice; and\n(b) the variation is of a kind specified in the regulations; and\n\nChapter 2  Australian Register of Therapeutic Goods\n\nSection 9D\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(c) the conditions (if any) specified in the regulations are\nsatisfied;\nthe Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request.",
      "skos:definition": "(3C) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom a kind of medical device is\nincluded in the Register has requested the Secretary to vary\ninformation included in the entry in the Register that relates\nto the kind of medical device; and\n(b) the only effect of the variation would be:\n(i) to reduce the class of persons for whom the kind of\nmedical device is suitable; or\n(ii) to add a warning, restriction or precaution, that does not\ninclude any comparison of the kind of medical device\nwith any other therapeutic goods by reference to quality,\nsafety or performance;\nthe Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request.\n(3CB) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom a kind of medical device is\nincluded in the Register has requested the Secretary to vary\nthe entry in the Register that relates to the kind of medical\ndevice; and\n(b) the variation is of a kind specified in the regulations; and\n\nChapter 2  Australian Register of Therapeutic Goods\n\nSection 9D\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(c) the conditions (if any) specified in the regulations are\nsatisfied;\nthe Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3c-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3c-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3c-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3c-logic-descriptionlogic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3c-logic-alleninterval-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3c-logic-deontic-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-3c-logic-deontic-6"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0200ff3c57bdf9899fdff339cf2574e201d8017db0935fda2cb585532d4ad480",
      "skos:note": "Variation of entries in Register upon request"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-9d-ss-3c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9D(3C) Variation of entries in Register",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 59,
      "values:originalText": "(3C) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom a kind of medical device is\nincluded in the Register has requested the Secretary to vary\ninformation included in the entry in the Register that relates\nto the kind of medical device; and\n(b) the only effect of the variation would be:\n(i) to reduce the class of persons for whom the kind of\nmedical device is suitable; or\n(ii) to add a warning, restriction or precaution, that does not\ninclude any comparison of the kind of medical device\nwith any other therapeutic goods by reference to quality,\nsafety or performance;\nthe Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request.\n(3CB) If:\n(a) the person in relation to whom a kind of medical device is\nincluded in the Register has requested the Secretary to vary\nthe entry in the Register that relates to the kind of medical\ndevice; and\n(b) the variation is of a kind specified in the regulations; and\n\nChapter 2  Australian Register of Therapeutic Goods\n\nSection 9D\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(c) the conditions (if any) specified in the regulations are\nsatisfied;\nthe Secretary must vary the entry in accordance with the request."
    },
    {
