    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9D(4) Variation of entries in Register",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-9d-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n(a) particular therapeutic goods cease to be medical devices\nbecause of a declaration under subsection 41BD(3); and\n(b) those goods are included in the Register under Chapter 4 as a\nkind of medical device;\nthe Secretary must move the entry relating to the goods from the\npart of the Register for medical devices to whichever other part of\nthe Register is applicable.\nNote:\nVariations to the Register also occur to give effect to limited\ncancellations of entries of kinds of medical devices from the Register:\nsee subsection 41GO(2).\nForm and manner of requests",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If:\n(a) particular therapeutic goods cease to be medical devices\nbecause of a declaration under subsection 41BD(3); and\n(b) those goods are included in the Register under Chapter 4 as a\nkind of medical device;\nthe Secretary must move the entry relating to the goods from the\npart of the Register for medical devices to whichever other part of\nthe Register is applicable.\nNote:\nVariations to the Register also occur to give effect to limited\ncancellations of entries of kinds of medical devices from the Register:\nsee subsection 41GO(2).\nForm and manner of requests",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9d-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c7777b0612bfe49962582486faf9e48f06dfc78b2d893d7b86a58d11aa114da8",
      "skos:note": "Must move entry from medical devices part to applicable part of Register"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-9d-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9D(4) Variation of entries in Register",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 59,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n(a) particular therapeutic goods cease to be medical devices\nbecause of a declaration under subsection 41BD(3); and\n(b) those goods are included in the Register under Chapter 4 as a\nkind of medical device;\nthe Secretary must move the entry relating to the goods from the\npart of the Register for medical devices to whichever other part of\nthe Register is applicable.\nNote:\nVariations to the Register also occur to give effect to limited\ncancellations of entries of kinds of medical devices from the Register:\nsee subsection 41GO(2).\nForm and manner of requests"
    },
