      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Secretary may, by writing:\n(a) approve a form for particular kinds of requests under this\nsection; and\n(b) approve the manner of making particular kinds of requests\nunder this section.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The Secretary may, by writing:\n(a) approve a form for particular kinds of requests under this\nsection; and\n(b) approve the manner of making particular kinds of requests\nunder this section.",
      "values:partOf": {
