      "values:originalText": "(8) The Secretary may, by legislative instrument, determine a kind of\ninformation for the purposes of subparagraph (7)(g)(i).\nNote:\nSee also subsection 33(3A) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901."
    },
    {
