    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9f-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9F(7) Removal of entries from Register",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-9f-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.65",
      "values:originalText": "(7) If the Secretary removes an entry of goods from the Register under\nthis section, the Secretary must, as soon as practicable after the\nremoval, cause to be published in the Gazette, or on the\nDepartment’s website, a notice setting out particulars of the\nremoval.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) If the Secretary removes an entry of goods from the Register under\nthis section, the Secretary must, as soon as practicable after the\nremoval, cause to be published in the Gazette, or on the\nDepartment’s website, a notice setting out particulars of the\nremoval.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9f"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9f-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9f-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8161738457e3877d2d02251f316a0d1fcc828b9104b3de2d39ffcd6f8f5eefec",
      "skos:note": "Secretary must publish notice after removing entry from Register.",
      "dc:description": "Notice setting out particulars of removal"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-9f-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9F(7) Removal of entries from Register",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 65,
      "values:originalText": "(7) If the Secretary removes an entry of goods from the Register under\nthis section, the Secretary must, as soon as practicable after the\nremoval, cause to be published in the Gazette, or on the\nDepartment’s website, a notice setting out particulars of the\nremoval."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-9f-ss-7-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
