    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-9g-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9G(4) Criminal offences for false statements in requests for variation of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 66,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person makes a statement; and\n(b) the statement is made in or in connection with a request\nunder section 9D for the variation of an entry in the Register\nin relation to therapeutic goods; and\n(c) the statement is false or misleading in a material particular.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth."
    },
