      "cml:premiseText": "(a) a default standard applies to a class of therapeutic goods; and (b) another default standard applies to only some of the therapeutic goods within that class;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "the standard referred to in paragraph (a) does not apply in relation to the goods referred to in paragraph (b)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13(4) Special provisions relating to Ministerial standards and default",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-13-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.76",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n(a) therapeutic goods consist, or are represented to consist, of a\nmixture of ingredients or of a combination of component\nparts; and\n(b) a default standard is applicable to one or more of the\ningredients or one or more of the component parts; and\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nStandards  Part 3-1\n\nSection 13A\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(c) a default standard is applicable to the mixture or\ncombination;\nthe standard referred to in paragraph (b) does not apply in relation\nto the goods.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If:\n(a) therapeutic goods consist, or are represented to consist, of a\nmixture of ingredients or of a combination of component\nparts; and\n(b) a default standard is applicable to one or more of the\ningredients or one or more of the component parts; and\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nStandards  Part 3-1\n\nSection 13A\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(c) a default standard is applicable to the mixture or\ncombination;\nthe standard referred to in paragraph (b) does not apply in relation\nto the goods.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13-ss-4-norm"
        },
