    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13(5) Special provisions relating to Ministerial standards and default",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-13-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.76",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If:\n(a) therapeutic goods consist, or are represented to consist, of a\nmixture of ingredients or of a combination of component\nparts; and\n(b) there is no standard applicable to the mixture or combination\nbut a standard is applicable to one or more of the ingredients\nor one or more of the component parts;\nthe Minister may, by order published in the Gazette or on the\nDepartment’s website, determine that the standard does not apply\nto the goods. The order has effect accordingly.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If:\n(a) therapeutic goods consist, or are represented to consist, of a\nmixture of ingredients or of a combination of component\nparts; and\n(b) there is no standard applicable to the mixture or combination\nbut a standard is applicable to one or more of the ingredients\nor one or more of the component parts;\nthe Minister may, by order published in the Gazette or on the\nDepartment’s website, determine that the standard does not apply\nto the goods. The order has effect accordingly.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2932628a3a4888bf1f25def413ec60b7ac4aaab51fdb46bc4514e2c91aba6d17",
      "skos:note": "Minister may determine standard does not apply to therapeutic goods"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-13-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13(5) Special provisions relating to Ministerial standards and default",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 76,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If:\n(a) therapeutic goods consist, or are represented to consist, of a\nmixture of ingredients or of a combination of component\nparts; and\n(b) there is no standard applicable to the mixture or combination\nbut a standard is applicable to one or more of the ingredients\nor one or more of the component parts;\nthe Minister may, by order published in the Gazette or on the\nDepartment’s website, determine that the standard does not apply\nto the goods. The order has effect accordingly."
    },
