    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13(7) Special provisions relating to Ministerial standards and default",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-13-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.76",
      "values:originalText": "(7) For the purposes of this Act, in working out at a particular time if\ntherapeutic goods conform with a default standard applicable to the\ngoods, if:\n(a) after applying subsections (2) to (5), 2 or more default\nstandards are applicable to the goods at that time; and\n(b) at that time, the goods conform with at least one of those\nstandards but do not conform with at least one of those\nstandards;\nthen the default standards that the goods do not conform with are\ntaken not to apply to the goods at that time.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) For the purposes of this Act, in working out at a particular time if\ntherapeutic goods conform with a default standard applicable to the\ngoods, if:\n(a) after applying subsections (2) to (5), 2 or more default\nstandards are applicable to the goods at that time; and\n(b) at that time, the goods conform with at least one of those\nstandards but do not conform with at least one of those\nstandards;\nthen the default standards that the goods do not conform with are\ntaken not to apply to the goods at that time.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "65ee93d28d0dc45a098a41c28a4a0434d6ea652e82c4139303b25b33e5d2a9b4",
      "skos:note": "If multiple default standards apply, they are taken not to apply if goods conform with at least one but not all."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-13-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13(7) Special provisions relating to Ministerial standards and default",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 76,
      "values:originalText": "(7) For the purposes of this Act, in working out at a particular time if\ntherapeutic goods conform with a default standard applicable to the\ngoods, if:\n(a) after applying subsections (2) to (5), 2 or more default\nstandards are applicable to the goods at that time; and\n(b) at that time, the goods conform with at least one of those\nstandards but do not conform with at least one of those\nstandards;\nthen the default standards that the goods do not conform with are\ntaken not to apply to the goods at that time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-13-ss-7-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
