      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.86",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The consent of the Secretary under section 14 or 14A may be\ngiven:\n(a) unconditionally or subject to conditions; or\n(b) in respect of particular goods or classes of goods.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The consent of the Secretary under section 14 or 14A may be\ngiven:\n(a) unconditionally or subject to conditions; or\n(b) in respect of particular goods or classes of goods.",
      "values:partOf": {
