      "values:originalText": "(7) An offence against subsection (6) is an offence of strict liability.\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nStandards  Part 3-1\n\nSection 15AA\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(7) An offence against subsection (6) is an offence of strict liability.\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nStandards  Part 3-1\n\nSection 15AA\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
