    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19(3) Approvals or authorities for certain uses",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-19-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Without limiting the conditions to which an approval under\nsubsection (1) may be made subject, those conditions may include\na condition relating to the charges that may be made for the\ntherapeutic goods to which the approval relates.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Without limiting the conditions to which an approval under\nsubsection (1) may be made subject, those conditions may include\na condition relating to the charges that may be made for the\ntherapeutic goods to which the approval relates.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4d7b37901aba5715cfc400b300b48b7c6653e8fbf504a69b5595ff05c350bcf1",
      "skos:note": "Approval conditions may include charges for therapeutic goods."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-19-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19(3) Approvals or authorities for certain uses",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 96,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Without limiting the conditions to which an approval under\nsubsection (1) may be made subject, those conditions may include\na condition relating to the charges that may be made for the\ntherapeutic goods to which the approval relates."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19-ss-3-norm",
