    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19-ss-4a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19(4A) Approvals or authorities for certain uses",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-19-ss-4a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "(4A) The use by a person for experimental purposes in humans of\nspecified therapeutic goods that are the subject of an approval\ngranted to someone else under paragraph (1)(b) is subject to the\nconditions (if any) specified in the regulations relating to one or\nmore of the following:\n(a) the preconditions on the use of the goods for those purposes;\n(b) the principles to be followed in the use of the goods for those\npurposes;\n(c) the monitoring of the use, and the results of the use, of the\ngoods for those purposes;\n(d) the circumstances in which the person must cease the use of\nthe goods for those purposes.",
      "skos:definition": "(4A) The use by a person for experimental purposes in humans of\nspecified therapeutic goods that are the subject of an approval\ngranted to someone else under paragraph (1)(b) is subject to the\nconditions (if any) specified in the regulations relating to one or\nmore of the following:\n(a) the preconditions on the use of the goods for those purposes;\n(b) the principles to be followed in the use of the goods for those\npurposes;\n(c) the monitoring of the use, and the results of the use, of the\ngoods for those purposes;\n(d) the circumstances in which the person must cease the use of\nthe goods for those purposes.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19-ss-4a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19-ss-4a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a177de48d7bb05c6f28600096f16b73964fc7ac3dd87eaaf6d96583823b8b545",
      "skos:note": "Conditions for experimental use of therapeutic goods in humans"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-19-ss-4a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19(4A) Approvals or authorities for certain uses",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 96,
      "values:originalText": "(4A) The use by a person for experimental purposes in humans of\nspecified therapeutic goods that are the subject of an approval\ngranted to someone else under paragraph (1)(b) is subject to the\nconditions (if any) specified in the regulations relating to one or\nmore of the following:\n(a) the preconditions on the use of the goods for those purposes;\n(b) the principles to be followed in the use of the goods for those\npurposes;\n(c) the monitoring of the use, and the results of the use, of the\ngoods for those purposes;\n(d) the circumstances in which the person must cease the use of\nthe goods for those purposes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19-ss-4a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19-ss-4a"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19-ss-4a-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Regulation of experimental use",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Use by a person for experimental purposes in humans",
      "cml:conclusionText": "is subject to the conditions specified in the regulations"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19-ss-4b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19(4B) Approvals or authorities for certain uses",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-19-ss-4b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "(4B) If:\n(a) the Secretary grants an approval to a person under\nsubsection (1) for use of the kind referred to in\nparagraph (1)(b); and\n(b) the person requests the Secretary to do either or both of the\nfollowing:\n(i) vary the therapeutic goods specified in the approval;\n(ii) vary the conditions imposed under subsection (1) on the\napproval; and\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(4B) If:\n(a) the Secretary grants an approval to a person under\nsubsection (1) for use of the kind referred to in\nparagraph (1)(b); and\n(b) the person requests the Secretary to do either or both of the\nfollowing:\n(i) vary the therapeutic goods specified in the approval;\n(ii) vary the conditions imposed under subsection (1) on the\napproval; and\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-19-ss-4b-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cd149ce253051ebb6df79648b8b080665d31575241ad02e46e5119769459f25d",
      "skos:note": "Request for variation of therapeutic goods approval"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-19-ss-4b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19(4B) Approvals or authorities for certain uses",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 96,
      "values:originalText": "(4B) If:\n(a) the Secretary grants an approval to a person under\nsubsection (1) for use of the kind referred to in\nparagraph (1)(b); and\n(b) the person requests the Secretary to do either or both of the\nfollowing:\n(i) vary the therapeutic goods specified in the approval;\n(ii) vary the conditions imposed under subsection (1) on the\napproval; and\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
