      "cml:premiseText": "The person has not properly notified...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "An offence is committed."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-20-ss-1c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20(1C) Criminal offences relating to notifying the Secretary and to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-20-ss-1c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.114",
      "values:originalText": "(1C) For the purposes of paragraphs (1B)(c) and (1BA)(c):\n(a) a manufacturer is properly notified to the Secretary if:\n(i) the manufacturer was nominated, as a manufacturer of\nthe goods, in an application for the registration or listing\nof the goods; or\n(ii) the Secretary was subsequently informed in writing that\nthe manufacturer is a manufacturer of the goods; and\n(b) premises are properly notified to the Secretary if:\n(i) the premises were nominated, as premises used in the\nmanufacture of the goods, in an application for the\nregistration or listing of the goods; or\n(ii) the Secretary was subsequently informed in writing that\nthe premises are used in the manufacture of the goods.",
      "skos:definition": "(1C) For the purposes of paragraphs (1B)(c) and (1BA)(c):\n(a) a manufacturer is properly notified to the Secretary if:\n(i) the manufacturer was nominated, as a manufacturer of\nthe goods, in an application for the registration or listing\nof the goods; or\n(ii) the Secretary was subsequently informed in writing that\nthe manufacturer is a manufacturer of the goods; and\n(b) premises are properly notified to the Secretary if:\n(i) the premises were nominated, as premises used in the\nmanufacture of the goods, in an application for the\nregistration or listing of the goods; or\n(ii) the Secretary was subsequently informed in writing that\nthe premises are used in the manufacture of the goods.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-20"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-20-ss-1c-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-20-ss-1c-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2cc560039442327b97230baf25cfa97b64f4a0a793ac94735660b2d0a6e71d87",
      "skos:note": "Manufacturer and premises must be notified to the Secretary."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-20-ss-1c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20(1C) Criminal offences relating to notifying the Secretary and to",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 114,
      "values:originalText": "(1C) For the purposes of paragraphs (1B)(c) and (1BA)(c):\n(a) a manufacturer is properly notified to the Secretary if:\n(i) the manufacturer was nominated, as a manufacturer of\nthe goods, in an application for the registration or listing\nof the goods; or\n(ii) the Secretary was subsequently informed in writing that\nthe manufacturer is a manufacturer of the goods; and\n(b) premises are properly notified to the Secretary if:\n(i) the premises were nominated, as premises used in the\nmanufacture of the goods, in an application for the\nregistration or listing of the goods; or\n(ii) the Secretary was subsequently informed in writing that\nthe premises are used in the manufacture of the goods."
    },
