      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.114",
      "values:originalText": "(2D) An offence under subsection (2C) is an offence of strict liability.\nNote:\nFor strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(2D) An offence under subsection (2C) is an offence of strict liability.\nNote:\nFor strict liability, see section 6.1 of the Criminal Code.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
