    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-22d",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "22D Provisional determinations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-22d"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.133",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a person makes an application, in accordance with\nsubsection 22C(2), for a provisional determination relating to a\nmedicine, the Secretary must decide to make, or to refuse to make,\nthe determination.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If a person makes an application, in accordance with\nsubsection 22C(2), for a provisional determination relating to a\nmedicine, the Secretary must decide to make, or to refuse to make,\nthe determination.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-22d-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-22d-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "87f857880be4cab55d90a591fec34adfd14e773dfaf78197a4393079675dbd1c",
      "skos:note": "Secretary must decide on provisional determination"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-22d",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22D Provisional determinations",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 133,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a person makes an application, in accordance with\nsubsection 22C(2), for a provisional determination relating to a\nmedicine, the Secretary must decide to make, or to refuse to make,\nthe determination.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-22d-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-22d"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
