      "values:originalText": "(7) As soon as practicable after making the decision, the Secretary\nmust:\n(a) give the person written notice of the decision; and\n(b) if the Secretary refuses to extend the initial period—set out\nthe reasons for the refusal in the notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) As soon as practicable after making the decision, the Secretary\nmust:\n(a) give the person written notice of the decision; and\n(b) if the Secretary refuses to extend the initial period—set out\nthe reasons for the refusal in the notice.",
