    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-22e-ss-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "22E(9) Period during which provisional determination is in force",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-22e-ss-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.134",
      "values:originalText": "(9) If the person to whom the provisional determination relates makes\nan application under section 23 for provisional registration of the\nmedicine before the end of the initial period (or that period as\nextended), the determination remains in force until:\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(9) If the person to whom the provisional determination relates makes\nan application under section 23 for provisional registration of the\nmedicine before the end of the initial period (or that period as\nextended), the determination remains in force until:\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-22e"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-22e-ss-9-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "95b48c87e78c0ae0de468d5923bda9e164e0eaa888b2655c58c57c60120349d1",
      "skos:note": "Provisional determination remains in force until application for provisional registration is made."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-22e-ss-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22E(9) Period during which provisional determination is in force",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 134,
      "values:originalText": "(9) If the person to whom the provisional determination relates makes\nan application under section 23 for provisional registration of the\nmedicine before the end of the initial period (or that period as\nextended), the determination remains in force until:\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-22e-ss-9-norm",
