      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22F(3) Revocation of provisional determination",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 136,
      "values:originalText": "(3) As soon as practicable after making a revocation under this section,\nthe Secretary must:\n(a) give the person written notice of the revocation; and\n(b) for a revocation under subsection (1)—set out the reasons for\nthe revocation in the notice.\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nRegistration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2\nProvisional determinations for medicine  Division 1A\nSection 22F\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nDay revocation takes effect"
    },
    {
