      "skos:note": "Request must be made in accordance with a form approved by the Secretary and accompanied by the prescribed fee."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-22g-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "22G(8) Scientific advice about aspects of quality, safety or efficacy of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 138,
      "values:originalText": "(8) A request under this section:\n(a) must be made in accordance with a form approved, in\nwriting, by the Secretary; and\n(b) must be accompanied by the fee prescribed by the\nregulations; and\n(c) may be accompanied by any information or documents the\nperson making the request considers appropriate."
    },
