      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.141",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretary may, by notifiable instrument, specify different\nclasses of therapeutic goods for the purposes of section 23B.\n(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a class of therapeutic goods may\nbe specified by reference to one or more of the matters referred to\nin paragraphs 16(1)(a) to (g) or 16(1A)(a) to (d).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Secretary may, by notifiable instrument, specify different\nclasses of therapeutic goods for the purposes of section 23B.\n(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a class of therapeutic goods may\nbe specified by reference to one or more of the matters referred to\nin paragraphs 16(1)(a) to (g) or 16(1A)(a) to (d).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-23a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-23a-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c752610b64371c4eaec9dba78b58a1f9b76bd67afed5eadab4d53ea6205edb79"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-23a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "23A Classes of therapeutic goods",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 141,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretary may, by notifiable instrument, specify different\nclasses of therapeutic goods for the purposes of section 23B.\n(2) Without limiting subsection (1), a class of therapeutic goods may\nbe specified by reference to one or more of the matters referred to\nin paragraphs 16(1)(a) to (g) or 16(1A)(a) to (d)."
    },
