      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.174",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If a notice has been given, this Act (except subsection 60(5)) has\neffect as if:\n(a) the Secretary had decided not to list the medicine which is\nthe subject of the application; and\n(b) the Minister had made a decision under subsection 60(3)\nconfirming the decision of the Secretary; and\n(c) the Minister’s decision had been made on the day on which\nnotice was given to the Secretary under subsection (2).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If a notice has been given, this Act (except subsection 60(5)) has\neffect as if:\n(a) the Secretary had decided not to list the medicine which is\nthe subject of the application; and\n(b) the Minister had made a decision under subsection 60(3)\nconfirming the decision of the Secretary; and\n(c) the Minister’s decision had been made on the day on which\nnotice was given to the Secretary under subsection (2).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26ad"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26ad-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26ad-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d6c60b67c7ca0387b59b91f297b815ad1334a0a74ded09b97115d5a5ebad5263",
      "skos:note": "Refusal of listing of medicine without notice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-26ad-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26AD(4) Lapsing and deemed refusal of applications for listing of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 174,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If a notice has been given, this Act (except subsection 60(5)) has\neffect as if:\n(a) the Secretary had decided not to list the medicine which is\nthe subject of the application; and\n(b) the Minister had made a decision under subsection 60(3)\nconfirming the decision of the Secretary; and\n(c) the Minister’s decision had been made on the day on which\nnotice was given to the Secretary under subsection (2)."
    },
