      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.180",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination\nspecifying either or both of the following:\n(a) ingredients that must not be specified under paragraph (1)(a);\n(b) requirements that must not be specified under\nparagraph (1)(b) in relation to ingredients being contained in\nmedicine.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination\nspecifying either or both of the following:\n(a) ingredients that must not be specified under paragraph (1)(a);\n(b) requirements that must not be specified under\nparagraph (1)(b) in relation to ingredients being contained in\nmedicine.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bb"
      },
