      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.180",
      "values:originalText": "(8) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, a\ndetermination under this section may make provision in relation to\na matter by applying, adopting or incorporating any matter\ncontained in an instrument or other writing as in force or existing\nfrom time to time.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, a\ndetermination under this section may make provision in relation to\na matter by applying, adopting or incorporating any matter\ncontained in an instrument or other writing as in force or existing\nfrom time to time.",
      "values:partOf": {
