      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.182",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If such an application is made, the Secretary must carry out an\nassessment of whether the requirements set out in subsection (3)\nhave been met in relation to the application.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If such an application is made, the Secretary must carry out an\nassessment of whether the requirements set out in subsection (3)\nhave been met in relation to the application.",
