    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bd-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26BD(3) Requirements relating to an application for variation of a",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-26bd-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.182",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The requirements are as follows:\n(a) the application must be made in accordance with a form\napproved, in writing, by the Secretary;\n(b) the application must set out the recommendation sought;\n(c) the prescribed application fee must be paid;\n(d) the application must be delivered to an office of the\nDepartment specified in the form;\n(e) the application must be accompanied by information that is:\n(i) of a kind determined under subsection (8); and\n(ii) in a form determined under subsection (9).\nPassing preliminary assessment",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The requirements are as follows:\n(a) the application must be made in accordance with a form\napproved, in writing, by the Secretary;\n(b) the application must set out the recommendation sought;\n(c) the prescribed application fee must be paid;\n(d) the application must be delivered to an office of the\nDepartment specified in the form;\n(e) the application must be accompanied by information that is:\n(i) of a kind determined under subsection (8); and\n(ii) in a form determined under subsection (9).\nPassing preliminary assessment",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bd-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bd-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0b3f93b32a4e8b70cb85387c9cb421eddaa7c9c5f01fd828b433fbae4df6d62c",
      "skos:note": "Application requirements for variation of a",
      "dc:description": "information determined under subsection (8) and in a form determined under subsection (9)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-26bd-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26BD(3) Requirements relating to an application for variation of a",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 182,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The requirements are as follows:\n(a) the application must be made in accordance with a form\napproved, in writing, by the Secretary;\n(b) the application must set out the recommendation sought;\n(c) the prescribed application fee must be paid;\n(d) the application must be delivered to an office of the\nDepartment specified in the form;\n(e) the application must be accompanied by information that is:\n(i) of a kind determined under subsection (8); and\n(ii) in a form determined under subsection (9).\nPassing preliminary assessment"
    },
