      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.182",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the application has not passed preliminary assessment, the\nSecretary must, by written notice given to the applicant, refuse the\napplication.\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nRegistration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2\nRegistration and listing  Division 2\nSection 26BDA\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nApproval of forms etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If the application has not passed preliminary assessment, the\nSecretary must, by written notice given to the applicant, refuse the\napplication.\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nRegistration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2\nRegistration and listing  Division 2\nSection 26BDA\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nApproval of forms etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bd"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bd-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bd-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4af6faddd57aa78b39caea73786da008c49bf5ffaa54393fc7e99ac75bbd5e1f",
      "skos:note": "Refuse application if not passed preliminary assessment."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-26bd-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26BD(6) Requirements relating to an application for variation of a",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 182,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the application has not passed preliminary assessment, the\nSecretary must, by written notice given to the applicant, refuse the\napplication.\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nRegistration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2\nRegistration and listing  Division 2\nSection 26BDA\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nApproval of forms etc."
    },
