      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.182",
      "values:originalText": "(7) An approval of a form mentioned in paragraph (3)(a) may require\nor permit an application or information to be given in accordance\nwith specified software requirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.\nDetermination of kinds and forms of information",
      "skos:definition": "(7) An approval of a form mentioned in paragraph (3)(a) may require\nor permit an application or information to be given in accordance\nwith specified software requirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.\nDetermination of kinds and forms of information",
