      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.182",
      "values:originalText": "(8) The Secretary may, by legislative instrument, determine a kind of\ninformation for the purposes of subparagraph (3)(e)(i).",
      "skos:definition": "(8) The Secretary may, by legislative instrument, determine a kind of\ninformation for the purposes of subparagraph (3)(e)(i).",
      "values:partOf": {
