      "skos:note": "The Secretary may determine a kind of information for the purposes of subparagraph (3)(e)(i)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-26bd-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26BD(8) Requirements relating to an application for variation of a",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 182,
      "values:originalText": "(8) The Secretary may, by legislative instrument, determine a kind of\ninformation for the purposes of subparagraph (3)(e)(i)."
    },
    {
