      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 183,
      "values:originalText": "of a section 26BB determination\nDecision by Secretary whether to make recommendation\n(3) If:\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26be-norm",
