      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.186",
      "values:originalText": "(5) A determination under paragraph (1)(b) may make different\nprovision for different classes of medicines.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) A determination under paragraph (1)(b) may make different\nprovision for different classes of medicines.",
      "values:partOf": {
