    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bf-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26BF(6) Permissible indications",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-26bf-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.186",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, a\ndetermination under subsection (1) of this section may make\nprovision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or\nincorporating, with or without modification, any matter contained\nin an instrument or other writing as in force or existing from time\nto time.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, a\ndetermination under subsection (1) of this section may make\nprovision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or\nincorporating, with or without modification, any matter contained\nin an instrument or other writing as in force or existing from time\nto time.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bf"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bf-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-26bf-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d19355e47e9764bec9ee3e6e7aa48788613f60a8905b0e811e1e0fd852061fad",
      "skos:note": "Allows for incorporation of existing instruments or writings with modifications."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-26bf-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26BF(6) Permissible indications",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 186,
      "values:originalText": "(6) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, a\ndetermination under subsection (1) of this section may make\nprovision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or\nincorporating, with or without modification, any matter contained\nin an instrument or other writing as in force or existing from time\nto time."
    },
