      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to this section, if goods are included in the Register in\nrelation to a person, the goods remain so included until their\nregistration or listing is cancelled under this Part.\nNote:\nThe goods are taken not to be included in the Register while their\nregistration or listing is suspended: see section 29G.\nProvisionally registered medicine",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to this section, if goods are included in the Register in\nrelation to a person, the goods remain so included until their\nregistration or listing is cancelled under this Part.\nNote:\nThe goods are taken not to be included in the Register while their\nregistration or listing is suspended: see section 29G.\nProvisionally registered medicine",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8287395b6a5825496bceb82e8d2b62ad7a0e897875f0b14ff2e18f1473cc11bf",
      "skos:note": "Goods remain in the Register until registration or listing is cancelled."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-29-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "29(1) Duration of registration or listing",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 202,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to this section, if goods are included in the Register in\nrelation to a person, the goods remain so included until their\nregistration or listing is cancelled under this Part.\nNote:\nThe goods are taken not to be included in the Register while their\nregistration or listing is suspended: see section 29G.\nProvisionally registered medicine"
    },
    {
