    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "29(2) Duration of registration or listing",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-29-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If:\n(a) a person makes an application for provisional registration of\na medicine; and\n(b) in relation to that application, the Secretary decides under\nsubsection 25(3) to register the medicine; and\n(c) the medicine is included in the Register in relation to the\nperson;\nthen:\n(d) the medicine is provisionally registered; and\n(e) the medicine remains included in the Register for the\nprovisional registration period, unless the medicine’s\nregistration is cancelled under this Part earlier.\nNote:\nThe medicine is taken not to be included in the Register while its\nregistration is suspended: see section 29G.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If:\n(a) a person makes an application for provisional registration of\na medicine; and\n(b) in relation to that application, the Secretary decides under\nsubsection 25(3) to register the medicine; and\n(c) the medicine is included in the Register in relation to the\nperson;\nthen:\n(d) the medicine is provisionally registered; and\n(e) the medicine remains included in the Register for the\nprovisional registration period, unless the medicine’s\nregistration is cancelled under this Part earlier.\nNote:\nThe medicine is taken not to be included in the Register while its\nregistration is suspended: see section 29G.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bf10e9e5a0ae6265b6df1f851103b819014fde4c19142e23630452a02112435c",
      "skos:note": "Medicine provisional registration period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-29-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "29(2) Duration of registration or listing",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 202,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If:\n(a) a person makes an application for provisional registration of\na medicine; and\n(b) in relation to that application, the Secretary decides under\nsubsection 25(3) to register the medicine; and\n(c) the medicine is included in the Register in relation to the\nperson;\nthen:\n(d) the medicine is provisionally registered; and\n(e) the medicine remains included in the Register for the\nprovisional registration period, unless the medicine’s\nregistration is cancelled under this Part earlier.\nNote:\nThe medicine is taken not to be included in the Register while its\nregistration is suspended: see section 29G."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "29(3) Duration of registration or listing",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-29-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subject to this section, the provisional registration period, for a\nmedicine that is provisionally registered because of an application\nthat, under subsection 23AA(1), is taken to be an application for\nprovisional registration of the medicine, is the period of 2 years\nstarting on the day the registration commences.\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nRegistration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2\nRegistration and listing  Division 2\nSection 29\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nNote:\nSubsection 25AB(6) provides that registration commences on the day\nspecified in the certificate of registration.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Subject to this section, the provisional registration period, for a\nmedicine that is provisionally registered because of an application\nthat, under subsection 23AA(1), is taken to be an application for\nprovisional registration of the medicine, is the period of 2 years\nstarting on the day the registration commences.\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nRegistration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2\nRegistration and listing  Division 2\nSection 29\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nNote:\nSubsection 25AB(6) provides that registration commences on the day\nspecified in the certificate of registration.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b35f241a759e4f4093406d84cc6b3a78fa51e60f6eaca234489d1da9eb441745",
      "skos:note": "Defines provisional registration period for medicines"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-29-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "29(3) Duration of registration or listing",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 202,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subject to this section, the provisional registration period, for a\nmedicine that is provisionally registered because of an application\nthat, under subsection 23AA(1), is taken to be an application for\nprovisional registration of the medicine, is the period of 2 years\nstarting on the day the registration commences.\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nRegistration and listing of therapeutic goods  Part 3-2\nRegistration and listing  Division 2\nSection 29\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nNote:\nSubsection 25AB(6) provides that registration commences on the day\nspecified in the certificate of registration."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "29(3A) Duration of registration or listing",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-29-ss-3a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "(3A) Subject to this section, the provisional registration period, for a\nmedicine (the new medicine) that is provisionally registered\nbecause of an application that, under subsection 23AA(2), is taken\nto be an application for provisional registration of the new\nmedicine, is as follows:\n(a) if, in relation to the new medicine, the day (the start day)\nreferred to in subsection 25AB(6) occurs in the period (the\noriginal period) referred to in subsection (3) of this section in\nrelation to the original medicine concerned—the period\nstarting on the start day and ending at the end of the original\nperiod;\n(b) if, in relation to the new medicine, the start day occurs in a\nperiod of extension of the original period that is granted\nunder subsection (6)—the period starting on the start day and\nending at the end of that extension period.\nNote:\nSubsection 25AB(6) provides that registration commences on the day\nspecified in the certificate of registration.\nExtension of provisional registration upon application",
      "skos:definition": "(3A) Subject to this section, the provisional registration period, for a\nmedicine (the new medicine) that is provisionally registered\nbecause of an application that, under subsection 23AA(2), is taken\nto be an application for provisional registration of the new\nmedicine, is as follows:\n(a) if, in relation to the new medicine, the day (the start day)\nreferred to in subsection 25AB(6) occurs in the period (the\noriginal period) referred to in subsection (3) of this section in\nrelation to the original medicine concerned—the period\nstarting on the start day and ending at the end of the original\nperiod;\n(b) if, in relation to the new medicine, the start day occurs in a\nperiod of extension of the original period that is granted\nunder subsection (6)—the period starting on the start day and\nending at the end of that extension period.\nNote:\nSubsection 25AB(6) provides that registration commences on the day\nspecified in the certificate of registration.\nExtension of provisional registration upon application",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-3a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-3a-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "92beafd442b62c52a761527ff9bd7f5ded74102583818ae92c2e83e582c74ad4",
      "skos:note": "Defines provisional registration period for a new medicine"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-29-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "29(3A) Duration of registration or listing",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 202,
      "values:originalText": "(3A) Subject to this section, the provisional registration period, for a\nmedicine (the new medicine) that is provisionally registered\nbecause of an application that, under subsection 23AA(2), is taken\nto be an application for provisional registration of the new\nmedicine, is as follows:\n(a) if, in relation to the new medicine, the day (the start day)\nreferred to in subsection 25AB(6) occurs in the period (the\noriginal period) referred to in subsection (3) of this section in\nrelation to the original medicine concerned—the period\nstarting on the start day and ending at the end of the original\nperiod;\n(b) if, in relation to the new medicine, the start day occurs in a\nperiod of extension of the original period that is granted\nunder subsection (6)—the period starting on the start day and\nending at the end of that extension period.\nNote:\nSubsection 25AB(6) provides that registration commences on the day\nspecified in the certificate of registration.\nExtension of provisional registration upon application"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-3a-norm",
