    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "29(5) Duration of registration or listing",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-29-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The application must:\n(a) be in a form approved, in writing, by the Secretary; and\n(b) contain the information that the form requires, and any\nfurther information, statement or document the Secretary\nrequires, whether in the form or otherwise; and\n(c) be made:\n(i) if the medicine is provisionally registered because of an\napplication that, under subsection 23AA(1), was taken\nto be an application for provisional registration of the\nmedicine—at least 6 months before the provisional\nregistration of the medicine is due to end; or\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The application must:\n(a) be in a form approved, in writing, by the Secretary; and\n(b) contain the information that the form requires, and any\nfurther information, statement or document the Secretary\nrequires, whether in the form or otherwise; and\n(c) be made:\n(i) if the medicine is provisionally registered because of an\napplication that, under subsection 23AA(1), was taken\nto be an application for provisional registration of the\nmedicine—at least 6 months before the provisional\nregistration of the medicine is due to end; or\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-29-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0b6eb52cddbaae195bd9e85bce5904e07721897b98080eac127e0e9a329530f0",
      "skos:note": "Application must be in a specific form and contain required information.",
      "dc:description": "The application must be in a form approved by the Secretary and contain all required information."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-29-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "29(5) Duration of registration or listing",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 202,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The application must:\n(a) be in a form approved, in writing, by the Secretary; and\n(b) contain the information that the form requires, and any\nfurther information, statement or document the Secretary\nrequires, whether in the form or otherwise; and\n(c) be made:\n(i) if the medicine is provisionally registered because of an\napplication that, under subsection 23AA(1), was taken\nto be an application for provisional registration of the\nmedicine—at least 6 months before the provisional\nregistration of the medicine is due to end; or\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
    {
