      "skos:note": "Secretary must give applicant written notice requiring action upon withdrawal or lapse of application.",
      "dc:description": "written notice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-29b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "29B Notification of adverse effects etc. where application withdrawn",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 207,
      "values:originalText": "or lapses\n(1) If an application for registration or listing of goods is withdrawn or\nlapses, the Secretary may give the applicant written notice\nrequiring the applicant:\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
