      "skos:note": "Secretary must give written notice to Gene Technology Regulator about application.",
      "dc:description": "Advice on application"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-30c-ss-2",
