    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30c-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "30C(5) Consultation with Gene Technology Regulator",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-30c-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.219",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an advice from the Gene Technology Regulator is in force under\nsection 30D in relation to a class of therapeutic goods, the\nSecretary is not required to notify the Regulator under this section\nin relation to an application for listing or registration of a\ntherapeutic good belonging to that class.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If an advice from the Gene Technology Regulator is in force under\nsection 30D in relation to a class of therapeutic goods, the\nSecretary is not required to notify the Regulator under this section\nin relation to an application for listing or registration of a\ntherapeutic good belonging to that class.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30c"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30c-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30c-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30c-ss-5-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5f40412a2d7255cdc752c18f3acd09164aeec6439f54ee3a019896d4338fb35a",
      "skos:note": "No notification required for therapeutic goods belonging to a class with an active advice from the Gene Technology Regulator."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-30c-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "30C(5) Consultation with Gene Technology Regulator",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 219,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an advice from the Gene Technology Regulator is in force under\nsection 30D in relation to a class of therapeutic goods, the\nSecretary is not required to notify the Regulator under this section\nin relation to an application for listing or registration of a\ntherapeutic good belonging to that class.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30c-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
