    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30ef-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "30EF(4) Reporting medicine shortages",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-30ef-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.228",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A notification under subsection (1) must:\n(a) be in accordance with a form that is approved, in writing, by\nthe Secretary; and\n(aa) specify the period of the shortage of the medicine in\nAustralia; and\n(b) contain any other information required by that form.\nNote:\nFor period of a shortage of a medicine in Australia, see section 30EIA.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A notification under subsection (1) must:\n(a) be in accordance with a form that is approved, in writing, by\nthe Secretary; and\n(aa) specify the period of the shortage of the medicine in\nAustralia; and\n(b) contain any other information required by that form.\nNote:\nFor period of a shortage of a medicine in Australia, see section 30EIA.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30ef"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30ef-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30ef-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6768b9138dc76e3662afbba407f7e5c9fdcfefd8eeb623392a966f3ba2ec9567",
      "skos:note": "Notification requirements for medicine shortages",
      "dc:description": "Specific period of shortage, approved form, and required information"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-30ef-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "30EF(4) Reporting medicine shortages",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 228,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A notification under subsection (1) must:\n(a) be in accordance with a form that is approved, in writing, by\nthe Secretary; and\n(aa) specify the period of the shortage of the medicine in\nAustralia; and\n(b) contain any other information required by that form.\nNote:\nFor period of a shortage of a medicine in Australia, see section 30EIA."
    },
