      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.228",
      "values:originalText": "(6) A person contravenes this subsection if:\n(a) the person is subject to a requirement under subsection (1);\nand\n(b) the person contravenes the requirement.\nMaximum civil penalty:\n(a) for an individual—100 penalty units; and\n(b) for a body corporate—1,000 penalty units.\nExceptions",
      "skos:definition": "(6) A person contravenes this subsection if:\n(a) the person is subject to a requirement under subsection (1);\nand\n(b) the person contravenes the requirement.\nMaximum civil penalty:\n(a) for an individual—100 penalty units; and\n(b) for a body corporate—1,000 penalty units.\nExceptions",
      "values:partOf": {
