      "values:originalText": "(5) An approval of a form may require or permit information to be\ngiven in accordance with specified software requirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(5) An approval of a form may require or permit information to be\ngiven in accordance with specified software requirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30eg"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
