      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the medicine is critical to the health of patients in Australia;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Minister MUST determine a medicine if it meets certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30ej",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "30EJ Medicines Watch List",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-30ej"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.235",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine medicine\nfor the purposes of subsections 30EF(2) and 30EG(2).\n(2) The Minister must not determine a medicine unless the Minister is\nsatisfied that any shortage of the medicine, or any permanent\ndiscontinuation of the supply of the medicine, in Australia has the\npotential to result in:\n(a) significant morbidity in patients in Australia; or\n(b) the death of one or more patients in Australia.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine medicine\nfor the purposes of subsections 30EF(2) and 30EG(2).\n(2) The Minister must not determine a medicine unless the Minister is\nsatisfied that any shortage of the medicine, or any permanent\ndiscontinuation of the supply of the medicine, in Australia has the\npotential to result in:\n(a) significant morbidity in patients in Australia; or\n(b) the death of one or more patients in Australia.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-30ej-ss-1"
        },
