    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "31A Secretary may require information etc. about goods exempt",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-31a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.249",
      "values:originalText": "under section 18\nExempt goods for use for experimental purposes in humans\n(1) If therapeutic goods are exempt under subsection 18(1) from the\noperation of this Part (except this section and sections 31C to 31F)\nto allow for their use for experimental purposes in humans, the\nSecretary may give the sponsor of the goods a written notice\nrequiring the sponsor to give to the Secretary specified information\nor documents relating to one or more of the following:\n(a) the supply of the goods;\n(b) the handling of the goods;\n(c) the monitoring of the supply of the goods;\n(d) the results of the supply of the goods;\n(e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of this paragraph in relation to goods of that kind.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "under section 18\nExempt goods for use for experimental purposes in humans\n(1) If therapeutic goods are exempt under subsection 18(1) from the\noperation of this Part (except this section and sections 31C to 31F)\nto allow for their use for experimental purposes in humans, the\nSecretary may give the sponsor of the goods a written notice\nrequiring the sponsor to give to the Secretary specified information\nor documents relating to one or more of the following:\n(a) the supply of the goods;\n(b) the handling of the goods;\n(c) the monitoring of the supply of the goods;\n(d) the results of the supply of the goods;\n(e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of this paragraph in relation to goods of that kind.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e301885500dfdc53b65c9cbb5f7acd042e0e1b4a1d7440aef269bc1e24ef05db",
      "skos:note": "Secretary may require sponsor to provide specified information about exempt goods for experimental purposes in humans.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-31a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "31A Secretary may require information etc. about goods exempt",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 249,
      "values:originalText": "under section 18\nExempt goods for use for experimental purposes in humans\n(1) If therapeutic goods are exempt under subsection 18(1) from the\noperation of this Part (except this section and sections 31C to 31F)\nto allow for their use for experimental purposes in humans, the\nSecretary may give the sponsor of the goods a written notice\nrequiring the sponsor to give to the Secretary specified information\nor documents relating to one or more of the following:\n(a) the supply of the goods;\n(b) the handling of the goods;\n(c) the monitoring of the supply of the goods;\n(d) the results of the supply of the goods;\n(e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of this paragraph in relation to goods of that kind.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
