    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31aa",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "31AA Secretary may require information etc. about goods exempt",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-31aa"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.251",
      "values:originalText": "under section 18A\n(1) This section applies to a person who is required to comply with a\ncondition of an exemption of therapeutic goods under section 18A.\n(2) The Secretary may, by written notice given to the person, require\nthe person to give to the Secretary specified information or\ndocuments relating to one or more of the following:\n(a) the supply of any of those goods;\n(b) the handling of any of those goods;\n(c) the monitoring of the supply of any of those goods;\n(d) the results of the supply of any of those goods;\n(e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of this paragraph.\nCompliance period\n(3) The notice must specify a reasonable period within which the\nperson must comply with it. The period must be at least 14 days\nstarting on the day on which the notice is given.\nInformation may need to be given in accordance with specified\nsoftware requirements\n(4) The notice may require information to be given in accordance with\nspecified software requirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.",
      "skos:definition": "under section 18A\n(1) This section applies to a person who is required to comply with a\ncondition of an exemption of therapeutic goods under section 18A.\n(2) The Secretary may, by written notice given to the person, require\nthe person to give to the Secretary specified information or\ndocuments relating to one or more of the following:\n(a) the supply of any of those goods;\n(b) the handling of any of those goods;\n(c) the monitoring of the supply of any of those goods;\n(d) the results of the supply of any of those goods;\n(e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of this paragraph.\nCompliance period\n(3) The notice must specify a reasonable period within which the\nperson must comply with it. The period must be at least 14 days\nstarting on the day on which the notice is given.\nInformation may need to be given in accordance with specified\nsoftware requirements\n(4) The notice may require information to be given in accordance with\nspecified software requirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31aa-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31aa-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31aa-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31aa-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c6f998e68ddcbd55bff9d37cc2c21469aa6b9847c82f2c01efd57fcb40f3166f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-31aa",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "31AA Secretary may require information etc. about goods exempt",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 251,
      "values:originalText": "under section 18A\n(1) This section applies to a person who is required to comply with a\ncondition of an exemption of therapeutic goods under section 18A.\n(2) The Secretary may, by written notice given to the person, require\nthe person to give to the Secretary specified information or\ndocuments relating to one or more of the following:\n(a) the supply of any of those goods;\n(b) the handling of any of those goods;\n(c) the monitoring of the supply of any of those goods;\n(d) the results of the supply of any of those goods;\n(e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of this paragraph.\nCompliance period\n(3) The notice must specify a reasonable period within which the\nperson must comply with it. The period must be at least 14 days\nstarting on the day on which the notice is given.\nInformation may need to be given in accordance with specified\nsoftware requirements\n(4) The notice may require information to be given in accordance with\nspecified software requirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission."
    },
