    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "31B Secretary may require information relating to approvals and",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-31b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.251",
      "values:originalText": "authorities under section 19\nApproval under subsection 19(1)\n(1) The Secretary may give to a person who is granted an approval\nunder subsection 19(1) in relation to specified therapeutic goods a\nwritten notice requiring the person to give to the Secretary\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "authorities under section 19\nApproval under subsection 19(1)\n(1) The Secretary may give to a person who is granted an approval\nunder subsection 19(1) in relation to specified therapeutic goods a\nwritten notice requiring the person to give to the Secretary\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31b-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bef4ff44bc88275ff356fff89618a6d74be64a80d041fd0f95d83862153f4ad7",
      "skos:note": "Secretary may require information from a person granted an approval under subsection 19(1)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-31b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "31B Secretary may require information relating to approvals and",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 251,
      "values:originalText": "authorities under section 19\nApproval under subsection 19(1)\n(1) The Secretary may give to a person who is granted an approval\nunder subsection 19(1) in relation to specified therapeutic goods a\nwritten notice requiring the person to give to the Secretary\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31b-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31b"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31ba",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "31BA Secretary may require information about therapeutic goods",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-31ba"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.254",
      "values:originalText": "approved under section 19A\n(1) The Secretary may give to a person who is granted an approval\nunder subsection 19A(1), (1A), (2), (2A) or (2B) in relation to\nspecified therapeutic goods a written notice requiring the person to\ngive to the Secretary specified information, or to produce to the\nSecretary specified documents, relating to one or more of the\nfollowing:\n(a) the supply of the goods;\n(b) the handling of the goods;\n(c) the monitoring of the supply of the goods;\n(d) the results of the supply of the goods;\n(e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations.\nCompliance\n(2) A person given a notice under subsection (1) must give the\ninformation, or produce the documents, to the Secretary:\n(a) within the period specified in the notice (which must not be\nless than 14 days after the day the notice is given); and\n(b) in the form specified in the notice.\n(3) The form may require or permit the information to be given, or the\ndocuments to be produced, in accordance with specified software\nrequirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.",
      "skos:definition": "approved under section 19A\n(1) The Secretary may give to a person who is granted an approval\nunder subsection 19A(1), (1A), (2), (2A) or (2B) in relation to\nspecified therapeutic goods a written notice requiring the person to\ngive to the Secretary specified information, or to produce to the\nSecretary specified documents, relating to one or more of the\nfollowing:\n(a) the supply of the goods;\n(b) the handling of the goods;\n(c) the monitoring of the supply of the goods;\n(d) the results of the supply of the goods;\n(e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations.\nCompliance\n(2) A person given a notice under subsection (1) must give the\ninformation, or produce the documents, to the Secretary:\n(a) within the period specified in the notice (which must not be\nless than 14 days after the day the notice is given); and\n(b) in the form specified in the notice.\n(3) The form may require or permit the information to be given, or the\ndocuments to be produced, in accordance with specified software\nrequirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31ba-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31ba-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31ba-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "04847e4713245e7bf2b31e2862d72f050a9af1ed10d7fc52de020585a81c0145"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-31ba",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "31BA Secretary may require information about therapeutic goods",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 254,
      "values:originalText": "approved under section 19A\n(1) The Secretary may give to a person who is granted an approval\nunder subsection 19A(1), (1A), (2), (2A) or (2B) in relation to\nspecified therapeutic goods a written notice requiring the person to\ngive to the Secretary specified information, or to produce to the\nSecretary specified documents, relating to one or more of the\nfollowing:\n(a) the supply of the goods;\n(b) the handling of the goods;\n(c) the monitoring of the supply of the goods;\n(d) the results of the supply of the goods;\n(e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations.\nCompliance\n(2) A person given a notice under subsection (1) must give the\ninformation, or produce the documents, to the Secretary:\n(a) within the period specified in the notice (which must not be\nless than 14 days after the day the notice is given); and\n(b) in the form specified in the notice.\n(3) The form may require or permit the information to be given, or the\ndocuments to be produced, in accordance with specified software\nrequirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission."
    },
