    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31d",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "31D False or misleading information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-31d"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.255",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person to whom a notice is given under section 31A, 31AA, 31B\nor 31BA commits an offence if:\n(a) the person gives information to the Secretary in compliance\nor purported compliance with the notice; and\n(b) the person does so knowing that the information:\n(i) is false or misleading; or\n(ii) omits any matter or thing without which the information\nis misleading.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth.\nNote:\nFor the liability of an executive officer of a body corporate, see\nsections 54B and 54BA.\n(1A) A person to whom a notice is given under section 31A, 31AA, 31B\nor 31BA commits an offence if:\n(a) the person gives information to the Secretary in compliance\nor purported compliance with the notice; and\n(b) the information:\n(i) is false or misleading; or\n(ii) omits any matter or thing without which the information\nis misleading.\nPenalty: 100 penalty units.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person to whom a notice is given under section 31A, 31AA, 31B\nor 31BA commits an offence if:\n(a) the person gives information to the Secretary in compliance\nor purported compliance with the notice; and\n(b) the person does so knowing that the information:\n(i) is false or misleading; or\n(ii) omits any matter or thing without which the information\nis misleading.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth.\nNote:\nFor the liability of an executive officer of a body corporate, see\nsections 54B and 54BA.\n(1A) A person to whom a notice is given under section 31A, 31AA, 31B\nor 31BA commits an offence if:\n(a) the person gives information to the Secretary in compliance\nor purported compliance with the notice; and\n(b) the information:\n(i) is false or misleading; or\n(ii) omits any matter or thing without which the information\nis misleading.\nPenalty: 100 penalty units.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31d-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31d-ss-1a"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3c600165ee94176f3de280b002b9fc7b8941edc20a681f37cf7676159c24230f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-31d",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "31D False or misleading information",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 255,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person to whom a notice is given under section 31A, 31AA, 31B\nor 31BA commits an offence if:\n(a) the person gives information to the Secretary in compliance\nor purported compliance with the notice; and\n(b) the person does so knowing that the information:\n(i) is false or misleading; or\n(ii) omits any matter or thing without which the information\nis misleading.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth.\nNote:\nFor the liability of an executive officer of a body corporate, see\nsections 54B and 54BA.\n(1A) A person to whom a notice is given under section 31A, 31AA, 31B\nor 31BA commits an offence if:\n(a) the person gives information to the Secretary in compliance\nor purported compliance with the notice; and\n(b) the information:\n(i) is false or misleading; or\n(ii) omits any matter or thing without which the information\nis misleading.\nPenalty: 100 penalty units.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
