    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31f",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "31F Self-incrimination",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-31f"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.257",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person is not excused from giving information or a document\nunder a notice given under section 31, 31A, 31AA, 31B or 31BA\non the ground that the giving of the information or document\nwould tend to incriminate the person or expose the person to a\npenalty.\n(2) However, in the case of an individual:\n(a) the information given; or\n(b) the giving of the document; or\n(c) any information, document or thing obtained as a direct or\nindirect consequence of giving the information or document;\nis not admissible in evidence in:\n(d) criminal proceedings against the individual, except\nproceedings under, or arising out of, subsection 31(5A), (6)\nor (7) or section 31D or 31E; or\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person is not excused from giving information or a document\nunder a notice given under section 31, 31A, 31AA, 31B or 31BA\non the ground that the giving of the information or document\nwould tend to incriminate the person or expose the person to a\npenalty.\n(2) However, in the case of an individual:\n(a) the information given; or\n(b) the giving of the document; or\n(c) any information, document or thing obtained as a direct or\nindirect consequence of giving the information or document;\nis not admissible in evidence in:\n(d) criminal proceedings against the individual, except\nproceedings under, or arising out of, subsection 31(5A), (6)\nor (7) or section 31D or 31E; or\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31f-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-31f-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9e9d790283b51fbb1cb977ae7374939fe4c84bd058d470e490661c325f64038c"
    },
