      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.284",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), number includes any\ncombination of one or more of the following:\n(a) numbers;\n(b) letters;\n(c) symbols.\nAdvertising biological for an indication",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), number includes any\ncombination of one or more of the following:\n(a) numbers;\n(b) letters;\n(c) symbols.\nAdvertising biological for an indication",
      "values:partOf": {
