      },
      "cml:operator": "ClassHierarchy",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Exemptions under section 32CB are subject to conditions",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cd",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32CD Variation or revocation of exemption",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32cd"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.291",
      "values:originalText": "Variation of exemption\n(1) The Minister may, by writing, vary an exemption made under\nsection 32CB by removing specified biologicals from the\nexemption.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 33(3AB) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\nRevocation of exemption\n(2) The Minister may, by writing, revoke an exemption made under\nsection 32CB.\nVariation or revocation of conditions\n(3) The Minister may, by writing:\n(a) vary the conditions of an exemption made under\nsection 32CB (including by imposing new conditions); or\n(b) revoke the conditions of an exemption made under\nsection 32CB.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "Variation of exemption\n(1) The Minister may, by writing, vary an exemption made under\nsection 32CB by removing specified biologicals from the\nexemption.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 33(3AB) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\nRevocation of exemption\n(2) The Minister may, by writing, revoke an exemption made under\nsection 32CB.\nVariation or revocation of conditions\n(3) The Minister may, by writing:\n(a) vary the conditions of an exemption made under\nsection 32CB (including by imposing new conditions); or\n(b) revoke the conditions of an exemption made under\nsection 32CB.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cd-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cd-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cd-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c2f34d233068d447bce67a922c935760ef233255887c06da805ed973ebd562ed"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32cd",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32CD Variation or revocation of exemption",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 291,
      "values:originalText": "Variation of exemption\n(1) The Minister may, by writing, vary an exemption made under\nsection 32CB by removing specified biologicals from the\nexemption.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 33(3AB) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.\nRevocation of exemption\n(2) The Minister may, by writing, revoke an exemption made under\nsection 32CB.\nVariation or revocation of conditions\n(3) The Minister may, by writing:\n(a) vary the conditions of an exemption made under\nsection 32CB (including by imposing new conditions); or\n(b) revoke the conditions of an exemption made under\nsection 32CB.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
