      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.294",
      "values:originalText": "(7) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the Secretary gives a notice to the person under\nsubsection (2); and\n(b) the notice specifies a particular requirement mentioned in\nsubsection (3); and\n(c) the person fails to comply with that requirement.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the Secretary gives a notice to the person under\nsubsection (2); and\n(b) the notice specifies a particular requirement mentioned in\nsubsection (3); and\n(c) the person fails to comply with that requirement.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth.",
      "values:partOf": {
