      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(7) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the Secretary gives a notice to the person under\nsubsection (2); and\n(b) the notice specifies a particular requirement mentioned in\nsubsection (3); and\n(c) the person fails to comply with that requirement.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or both."
    },
