      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.296",
      "values:originalText": "(3) An application for an approval for use of the kind referred to in\nparagraph (1)(d) must:\n(a) be made to the Secretary; and\n(aa) be in a form (if any) approved, in writing, by the Secretary;\nand\n(b) be accompanied by such information relating to the\nbiological the subject of the application as is required by the\nSecretary.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) An application for an approval for use of the kind referred to in\nparagraph (1)(d) must:\n(a) be made to the Secretary; and\n(aa) be in a form (if any) approved, in writing, by the Secretary;\nand\n(b) be accompanied by such information relating to the\nbiological the subject of the application as is required by the\nSecretary.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ck"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ck-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ck-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6e176c2ed174eea921ab27fcb626351a859de766379b9c72e1453eaa3d9a738a",
      "skos:note": "Application for approval must be made to the Secretary and accompanied by required information.",
      "dc:description": "Information relating to the biological subject of the application"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32ck-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32CK(3) Approvals for importing, exporting or supplying a biological",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 296,
      "values:originalText": "(3) An application for an approval for use of the kind referred to in\nparagraph (1)(d) must:\n(a) be made to the Secretary; and\n(aa) be in a form (if any) approved, in writing, by the Secretary;\nand\n(b) be accompanied by such information relating to the\nbiological the subject of the application as is required by the\nSecretary."
    },
