    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ck-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32CK(5) Approvals for importing, exporting or supplying a biological",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32ck-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.296",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an application for an approval is made, the Secretary must:\n(a) after having considered the application; and\n(b) in the case of an application for an approval for use of the\nkind referred to in paragraph (1)(e)—after having evaluated\nthe information submitted with the application;\nnotify the applicant of the decision on the application as soon as\npracticable after making the decision and, in the case of a decision\nnot to grant the approval, of the reasons for the decision.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If an application for an approval is made, the Secretary must:\n(a) after having considered the application; and\n(b) in the case of an application for an approval for use of the\nkind referred to in paragraph (1)(e)—after having evaluated\nthe information submitted with the application;\nnotify the applicant of the decision on the application as soon as\npracticable after making the decision and, in the case of a decision\nnot to grant the approval, of the reasons for the decision.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ck"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ck-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ck-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1f01bb9a50b4abd4ae6370b9c2e964457ea7a388cba31f44448dc0ce383de087",
      "skos:note": "Secretary must notify applicant of decision on application as soon as practicable.",
      "dc:description": "Reasons for decision if not granting approval"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32ck-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32CK(5) Approvals for importing, exporting or supplying a biological",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 296,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an application for an approval is made, the Secretary must:\n(a) after having considered the application; and\n(b) in the case of an application for an approval for use of the\nkind referred to in paragraph (1)(e)—after having evaluated\nthe information submitted with the application;\nnotify the applicant of the decision on the application as soon as\npracticable after making the decision and, in the case of a decision\nnot to grant the approval, of the reasons for the decision.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
