      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.300",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Secretary may give an authority under subsection (1) subject\nto any conditions that are specified in the authority.\nNote:\nThere are criminal offences and a civil penalty related to the breach of\na condition of an authority: see sections 32CP and 32CQ.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Secretary may give an authority under subsection (1) subject\nto any conditions that are specified in the authority.\nNote:\nThere are criminal offences and a civil penalty related to the breach of\na condition of an authority: see sections 32CP and 32CQ.",
      "values:partOf": {
