    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm-ss-7a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32CM(7A) Authorities for health practitioners",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32cm-ss-7a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.300",
      "values:originalText": "(7A) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make rules\nauthorising any health practitioner who is included in a specified\nclass of health practitioners to supply a specified biological, for use\nin the treatment of humans, to the class or classes of recipients\nspecified in those rules, so long as:\n(a) the biological is supplied in the circumstances specified in\nthose rules; and\n(b) the conditions (if any) specified in those rules are satisfied.",
      "skos:definition": "(7A) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make rules\nauthorising any health practitioner who is included in a specified\nclass of health practitioners to supply a specified biological, for use\nin the treatment of humans, to the class or classes of recipients\nspecified in those rules, so long as:\n(a) the biological is supplied in the circumstances specified in\nthose rules; and\n(b) the conditions (if any) specified in those rules are satisfied.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm-ss-7a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm-ss-7a-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm-ss-7a-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "72fbee116e9bcf24c7ddfea9fd972b87404fc52111ca4aa9d8b9c2ddef45e7a5",
      "skos:note": "The Minister may make rules authorising health practitioners to supply biologicals."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32cm-ss-7a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32CM(7A) Authorities for health practitioners",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 300,
      "values:originalText": "(7A) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make rules\nauthorising any health practitioner who is included in a specified\nclass of health practitioners to supply a specified biological, for use\nin the treatment of humans, to the class or classes of recipients\nspecified in those rules, so long as:\n(a) the biological is supplied in the circumstances specified in\nthose rules; and\n(b) the conditions (if any) specified in those rules are satisfied."
    },
