      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.300",
      "values:originalText": "(7B) In making rules under subsection (7A), the Minister must comply\nwith:\n(a) such requirements (if any) as are prescribed by the\nregulations; and\n(b) such restrictions (if any) as are prescribed by the regulations;\nand\n(c) such limitations (if any) as are prescribed by the regulations.",
      "skos:definition": "(7B) In making rules under subsection (7A), the Minister must comply\nwith:\n(a) such requirements (if any) as are prescribed by the\nregulations; and\n(b) such restrictions (if any) as are prescribed by the regulations;\nand\n(c) such limitations (if any) as are prescribed by the regulations.",
