    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm-ss-7c",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32CM(7C) Authorities for health practitioners",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32cm-ss-7c"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.300",
      "values:originalText": "(7C) If:\n(a) a person is authorised, by subsection (7A) rules, to supply a\nbiological; and\n(b) the person supplies the biological in accordance with those\nrules;\nthe person must:\n(c) notify the supply to the Secretary; and\n(d) do so within 28 days after the supply.",
      "skos:definition": "(7C) If:\n(a) a person is authorised, by subsection (7A) rules, to supply a\nbiological; and\n(b) the person supplies the biological in accordance with those\nrules;\nthe person must:\n(c) notify the supply to the Secretary; and\n(d) do so within 28 days after the supply.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm-ss-7c-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32cm-ss-7c-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "626e2da458734e9a587fa1a333a8ce482c07cf5cb3b0aa159a37d759f07bc9ff",
      "skos:note": "Notify supply to Secretary within 28 days after supply.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32cm-ss-7c",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32CM(7C) Authorities for health practitioners",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 300,
      "values:originalText": "(7C) If:\n(a) a person is authorised, by subsection (7A) rules, to supply a\nbiological; and\n(b) the person supplies the biological in accordance with those\nrules;\nthe person must:\n(c) notify the supply to the Secretary; and\n(d) do so within 28 days after the supply."
    },
