      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.300",
      "values:originalText": "(7D) A notification under subsection (7C) must:\n(a) be in accordance with a form that is approved, in writing, by\nthe Secretary; and\n(b) contain such information as is prescribed by the regulations.",
      "skos:definition": "(7D) A notification under subsection (7C) must:\n(a) be in accordance with a form that is approved, in writing, by\nthe Secretary; and\n(b) contain such information as is prescribed by the regulations.",
