      "cml:integrityHash": "4ee5ea41fc4a799f9008e7866dd1c3b9bc8c49d5d62a882753dcdda545903451",
      "skos:note": "The Secretary must evaluate a biological for inclusion in the Register, considering various factors. The regulations may empower the Secretary to make biologicals (priority applicant) determinations."
