        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32de-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4bf75d3653197b779b9a5539c3b4561e103a0096760081a530defb8ca3dc2842",
      "skos:note": "Regulations for applications of biologicals",
      "dc:description": "information that must accompany an application"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32de-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32DE(3) Evaluation of biologicals",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 324,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The regulations may make provision for and in relation to the\nfollowing matters:\n(a) applications for biologicals (priority applicant)\ndeterminations;\n(b) the approval by the Secretary of a form for such an\napplication;\n(c) information that must accompany such an application;\n(d) the application fee for such an application;\n(e) empowering the Secretary to give the applicant a written\nnotice requiring the applicant to give to the Secretary\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32de-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
