      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.327",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The certificate must:\n(a) specify the biological number of the biological; and\n(b) specify the day on which the inclusion of the biological in the\nRegister commences.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The certificate must:\n(a) specify the biological number of the biological; and\n(b) specify the day on which the inclusion of the biological in the\nRegister commences.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32df"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32df-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "75f5e41b9253d96e0c996bc8f7f6379601dd1d665f03d1d81df9618afe79d631",
      "skos:note": "Specifies requirements for a certificate's content regarding biological inclusion in the Register."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32df-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32DF(4) Inclusion of biological in the Register",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 327,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The certificate must:\n(a) specify the biological number of the biological; and\n(b) specify the day on which the inclusion of the biological in the\nRegister commences.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32df-ss-4-norm",
