    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32di",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32DI Evaluation fee",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32di"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.329",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If an application is made under section 32DD for a biological to be\nincluded in the Register, and the application has passed preliminary\nassessment, an evaluation fee specified in, or determined in\naccordance with, the regulations is payable by the applicant in\nrespect of the evaluation of the biological for inclusion in the\nRegister.\n(2) The Secretary must notify the applicant in writing of the amount of\nthe evaluation fee.\n32DJ  When evaluation fee due for payment\n(1) Subject to sections 32DK and 32DM, an evaluation fee payable by\nan applicant is due and payable on the day on which the applicant\nis notified of the amount of the evaluation fee.\n(2) The evaluation fee is payable in the manner prescribed by the\nregulations.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If an application is made under section 32DD for a biological to be\nincluded in the Register, and the application has passed preliminary\nassessment, an evaluation fee specified in, or determined in\naccordance with, the regulations is payable by the applicant in\nrespect of the evaluation of the biological for inclusion in the\nRegister.\n(2) The Secretary must notify the applicant in writing of the amount of\nthe evaluation fee.\n32DJ  When evaluation fee due for payment\n(1) Subject to sections 32DK and 32DM, an evaluation fee payable by\nan applicant is due and payable on the day on which the applicant\nis notified of the amount of the evaluation fee.\n(2) The evaluation fee is payable in the manner prescribed by the\nregulations.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32di-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32di-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32di-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32di-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f58749f7e0acd1001e46d09f772a505ba2f53eafa11a1602efc5995a984426e1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32di",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32DI Evaluation fee",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 329,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If an application is made under section 32DD for a biological to be\nincluded in the Register, and the application has passed preliminary\nassessment, an evaluation fee specified in, or determined in\naccordance with, the regulations is payable by the applicant in\nrespect of the evaluation of the biological for inclusion in the\nRegister.\n(2) The Secretary must notify the applicant in writing of the amount of\nthe evaluation fee.\n32DJ  When evaluation fee due for payment\n(1) Subject to sections 32DK and 32DM, an evaluation fee payable by\nan applicant is due and payable on the day on which the applicant\nis notified of the amount of the evaluation fee.\n(2) The evaluation fee is payable in the manner prescribed by the\nregulations."
    },
