      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.330",
      "values:originalText": "(6) A notification under subsection (2) is not a legislative instrument.\nSubdivision D—Transitional provisions for existing biologicals",
      "skos:definition": "(6) A notification under subsection (2) is not a legislative instrument.\nSubdivision D—Transitional provisions for existing biologicals",
      "values:partOf": {
