      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits making false statements in applications for biological inclusion.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The statement is made in, or in connection with, an application for inclusion of a biological in the Register.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "A person commits an offence if..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32do-ss-1-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits harm or injury to any person resulting from the use of the biological.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(i) the use of the biological has resulted in, will result in, or is likely to result in, harm or injury to any person;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "or (ii) the use of the biological, if the biological were used, would result in, or would be likely to result in, harm or injury to any person."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32do-ss-1-logic-linearlogic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LinearLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Imply",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Implies that the provision is related to harm or injury.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::linear",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(i) the use of the biological has resulted in, will result in, or is likely to result in, harm or injury to any person;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "or (ii) the use of the biological, if the biological were used, would result in, or would be likely to result in, harm or injury to any person."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32do-ss-1-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits making false statements in applications for biological inclusion.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the person makes a statement;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "and (b) the statement is made in, or in connection with, an application for inclusion of a biological in the Register."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32do-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32DO(4) Criminal offences for false statements in applications for",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32do-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.334",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person makes a statement; and\n(b) the statement is made in, or in connection with, an\napplication for inclusion of a biological in the Register; and\n(c) the statement is false or misleading in a material particular.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth.\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nBiologicals  Part 3-2A\nIncluding biologicals in the Register  Division 4\nSection 32DP\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person makes a statement; and\n(b) the statement is made in, or in connection with, an\napplication for inclusion of a biological in the Register; and\n(c) the statement is false or misleading in a material particular.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth.\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nBiologicals  Part 3-2A\nIncluding biologicals in the Register  Division 4\nSection 32DP\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32do"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32do-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32do-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "abd03b6bef0384250a00315152f44b464c65d81267309c327bc131579675cfba",
      "skos:note": "Making false statements in applications for inclusion of biologicals in the Register is an offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32do-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32DO(4) Criminal offences for false statements in applications for",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 334,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person makes a statement; and\n(b) the statement is made in, or in connection with, an\napplication for inclusion of a biological in the Register; and\n(c) the statement is false or misleading in a material particular.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth.\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nBiologicals  Part 3-2A\nIncluding biologicals in the Register  Division 4\nSection 32DP\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025"
