    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32dq",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32DQ Criminal offence and civil penalty for failing to notify adverse",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32dq"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.335",
      "values:originalText": "effects etc. of biological while it is included in the Register\nCriminal offence\n(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) a biological is included in the Register in relation to the\nperson; and\n(b) the person knows that particular information is information\nof a kind to which subsection (3) applies; and\n(c) the person fails to give that information to the Secretary\nwithin the period specified in the regulations (whether or not\nthe person has already given to the Secretary other\ninformation relating to the same matter).\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "effects etc. of biological while it is included in the Register\nCriminal offence\n(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) a biological is included in the Register in relation to the\nperson; and\n(b) the person knows that particular information is information\nof a kind to which subsection (3) applies; and\n(c) the person fails to give that information to the Secretary\nwithin the period specified in the regulations (whether or not\nthe person has already given to the Secretary other\ninformation relating to the same matter).\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32dq-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32dq-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "df485be7af1475b18b8908e5d1492812ab83aa3d0c56e543cade0fff9e83ba1e",
      "skos:note": "Failure to notify adverse effects of a biological included in the Register is an offence."
    },
    {
