    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ds",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32DS Consultation with Gene Technology Regulator",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32ds"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.339",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to an application for inclusion of a biological\nin the Register if the biological is, or contains, a GM product or a\ngenetically modified organism.\n(2) Subject to subsection (5), the Secretary must give written notice to\nthe Gene Technology Regulator:\n(a) stating that the application has been made; and\n(b) requesting the Gene Technology Regulator to give advice\nabout the application.\n(3) If the Secretary gives the Gene Technology Regulator a notice\nunder subsection (2), the Gene Technology Regulator may give\nwritten advice to the Secretary about the application.\n(4) The advice is to be given within the period specified in the notice.\n(5) If an advice from the Gene Technology Regulator is in force under\nsection 32DT in relation to a class of biologicals, the Secretary is\nnot required to notify the Gene Technology Regulator under this\nsection in relation to an application for inclusion in the Register of\na biological belonging to that class.\n(6) A notice under subsection (2) is not a legislative instrument.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies to an application for inclusion of a biological\nin the Register if the biological is, or contains, a GM product or a\ngenetically modified organism.\n(2) Subject to subsection (5), the Secretary must give written notice to\nthe Gene Technology Regulator:\n(a) stating that the application has been made; and\n(b) requesting the Gene Technology Regulator to give advice\nabout the application.\n(3) If the Secretary gives the Gene Technology Regulator a notice\nunder subsection (2), the Gene Technology Regulator may give\nwritten advice to the Secretary about the application.\n(4) The advice is to be given within the period specified in the notice.\n(5) If an advice from the Gene Technology Regulator is in force under\nsection 32DT in relation to a class of biologicals, the Secretary is\nnot required to notify the Gene Technology Regulator under this\nsection in relation to an application for inclusion in the Register of\na biological belonging to that class.\n(6) A notice under subsection (2) is not a legislative instrument.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ds-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ds-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ds-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ds-ss-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ds-ss-5"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ds-ss-6"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1c7d250bb5e9cd945faeb2ae5a591b319e925d98369dd5b1b574921275321057"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32ds",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32DS Consultation with Gene Technology Regulator",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 339,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to an application for inclusion of a biological\nin the Register if the biological is, or contains, a GM product or a\ngenetically modified organism.\n(2) Subject to subsection (5), the Secretary must give written notice to\nthe Gene Technology Regulator:\n(a) stating that the application has been made; and\n(b) requesting the Gene Technology Regulator to give advice\nabout the application.\n(3) If the Secretary gives the Gene Technology Regulator a notice\nunder subsection (2), the Gene Technology Regulator may give\nwritten advice to the Secretary about the application.\n(4) The advice is to be given within the period specified in the notice.\n(5) If an advice from the Gene Technology Regulator is in force under\nsection 32DT in relation to a class of biologicals, the Secretary is\nnot required to notify the Gene Technology Regulator under this\nsection in relation to an application for inclusion in the Register of\na biological belonging to that class.\n(6) A notice under subsection (2) is not a legislative instrument."
    },
