      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.339",
      "values:originalText": "(6) A notice under subsection (2) is not a legislative instrument.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) A notice under subsection (2) is not a legislative instrument.",
      "values:partOf": {
