    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32dt",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32DT Secretary may seek advice about classes of GM products or",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32dt"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.339",
      "values:originalText": "genetically modified organisms\n(1) The Secretary may request advice from the Gene Technology\nRegulator in relation to:\n(a) biologicals that consist of, or that contain, a GM product\nbelonging to a class of GM products specified in the request;\nor\n(b) biologicals that consist of, or that contain, genetically\nmodified organisms belonging to a class of genetically\nmodified organisms specified in the request.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "genetically modified organisms\n(1) The Secretary may request advice from the Gene Technology\nRegulator in relation to:\n(a) biologicals that consist of, or that contain, a GM product\nbelonging to a class of GM products specified in the request;\nor\n(b) biologicals that consist of, or that contain, genetically\nmodified organisms belonging to a class of genetically\nmodified organisms specified in the request.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32dt-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8b9f3a54fe96d74cd996e8477e33a6ea12d240d714f3bdf2cd697b3e7d18ab19",
      "skos:note": "The Secretary may request advice from the Gene Technology Regulator about specific GM products or organisms."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32dt",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32DT Secretary may seek advice about classes of GM products or",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 339,
      "values:originalText": "genetically modified organisms\n(1) The Secretary may request advice from the Gene Technology\nRegulator in relation to:\n(a) biologicals that consist of, or that contain, a GM product\nbelonging to a class of GM products specified in the request;\nor\n(b) biologicals that consist of, or that contain, genetically\nmodified organisms belonging to a class of genetically\nmodified organisms specified in the request.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32dt-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32dt"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32du",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32DU Secretary to take advice into account",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32du"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.340",
      "values:originalText": "If the Secretary receives advice from the Gene Technology\nRegulator:\n(a) in response to a notice under section 32DS within the period\nspecified in the notice; or\n(b) under section 32DT;\nthe Secretary must:\n(c) ensure that the advice is taken into account in making a\ndecision on the application to which the notice relates, or on\nan application to which the advice under section 32DT\nrelates, as the case requires; and\n(d) inform the Gene Technology Regulator of the decision on the\napplication.\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nBiologicals  Part 3-2A\nConditions  Division 5\nSection 32E\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "skos:definition": "If the Secretary receives advice from the Gene Technology\nRegulator:\n(a) in response to a notice under section 32DS within the period\nspecified in the notice; or\n(b) under section 32DT;\nthe Secretary must:\n(c) ensure that the advice is taken into account in making a\ndecision on the application to which the notice relates, or on\nan application to which the advice under section 32DT\nrelates, as the case requires; and\n(d) inform the Gene Technology Regulator of the decision on the\napplication.\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nBiologicals  Part 3-2A\nConditions  Division 5\nSection 32E\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32du-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32du-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32du-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1197cb1929b5c8073f900c10e133b790e91c1ee4285eeaeae25a7eccd5e314bc",
      "skos:note": "Secretary must take advice into account when making a decision on an application."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32du",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32DU Secretary to take advice into account",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 340,
      "values:originalText": "If the Secretary receives advice from the Gene Technology\nRegulator:\n(a) in response to a notice under section 32DS within the period\nspecified in the notice; or\n(b) under section 32DT;\nthe Secretary must:\n(c) ensure that the advice is taken into account in making a\ndecision on the application to which the notice relates, or on\nan application to which the advice under section 32DT\nrelates, as the case requires; and\n(d) inform the Gene Technology Regulator of the decision on the\napplication.\n\nMedicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices  Chapter 3\nBiologicals  Part 3-2A\nConditions  Division 5\nSection 32E\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025"
    },
    {
