      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.345",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In deciding whether to give the certification, subsections 25(2),\n(2E), (2F) and (2G) apply in a way corresponding to the way in\nwhich they apply for the purposes of paragraph 25(1)(g).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In deciding whether to give the certification, subsections 25(2),\n(2E), (2F) and (2G) apply in a way corresponding to the way in\nwhich they apply for the purposes of paragraph 25(1)(g).",
