    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ec",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32EC Imposition of conditions by legislative instrument",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32ec"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.345",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The inclusion of a biological in the Register is subject to the\nconditions set out in a determination under subsection (2).\n(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination\nsetting out conditions for the purposes of subsection (1), being\nconditions that relate to:\n(a) the manufacture of the biological; or\n(b) the custody, use, supply, disposal or destruction of the\nbiological; or\n(c) the keeping of records relating to the biological; or\n(ca) reporting requirements relating to the biological; or\n(d) matters dealt with in, or matters additional to matters dealt\nwith in, standards applicable to the biological; or\n(e) such other matters relating to the biological as the Minister\nthinks appropriate.\n(3) Without limiting subsection (2), different conditions may be\nspecified for different classes of biologicals.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The inclusion of a biological in the Register is subject to the\nconditions set out in a determination under subsection (2).\n(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination\nsetting out conditions for the purposes of subsection (1), being\nconditions that relate to:\n(a) the manufacture of the biological; or\n(b) the custody, use, supply, disposal or destruction of the\nbiological; or\n(c) the keeping of records relating to the biological; or\n(ca) reporting requirements relating to the biological; or\n(d) matters dealt with in, or matters additional to matters dealt\nwith in, standards applicable to the biological; or\n(e) such other matters relating to the biological as the Minister\nthinks appropriate.\n(3) Without limiting subsection (2), different conditions may be\nspecified for different classes of biologicals.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ec-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ec-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32ec-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "72adc1c8838484f34b714fae16d01c9799773ec877f17ae9aa0eb74ce98977e0"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32ec",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32EC Imposition of conditions by legislative instrument",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 345,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The inclusion of a biological in the Register is subject to the\nconditions set out in a determination under subsection (2).\n(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination\nsetting out conditions for the purposes of subsection (1), being\nconditions that relate to:\n(a) the manufacture of the biological; or\n(b) the custody, use, supply, disposal or destruction of the\nbiological; or\n(c) the keeping of records relating to the biological; or\n(ca) reporting requirements relating to the biological; or\n(d) matters dealt with in, or matters additional to matters dealt\nwith in, standards applicable to the biological; or\n(e) such other matters relating to the biological as the Minister\nthinks appropriate.\n(3) Without limiting subsection (2), different conditions may be\nspecified for different classes of biologicals.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
