    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32fc",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32FC Revocation of suspension",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32fc"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.351",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretary must revoke a suspension under section 32FA, by\nwritten notice given to the person in relation to whom the\nbiological is included in the Register, if the Secretary is satisfied\nthat:\n(a) the ground on which the biological was suspended from the\nRegister no longer applies; and\n(b) there are no other grounds for suspending the biological from\nthe Register.\n(2) The Secretary’s power to revoke the suspension may be exercised:\n(a) if the person in relation to whom the biological is included in\nthe Register applies in writing to the Secretary; or\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Secretary must revoke a suspension under section 32FA, by\nwritten notice given to the person in relation to whom the\nbiological is included in the Register, if the Secretary is satisfied\nthat:\n(a) the ground on which the biological was suspended from the\nRegister no longer applies; and\n(b) there are no other grounds for suspending the biological from\nthe Register.\n(2) The Secretary’s power to revoke the suspension may be exercised:\n(a) if the person in relation to whom the biological is included in\nthe Register applies in writing to the Secretary; or\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32fc-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32fc-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d5d6e09e3020d5be35c0c5887aaae5f0b6f38a79db388bc5c48511845e442509"
    },
    {
