    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32fd",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32FD Effect of suspension",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32fd"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.352",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a biological is suspended from the Register under section 32FA,\nthe biological is taken, for the purposes of this Act (other than\nsection 32DQ, Division 5, sections 32FB and 32FC and\nDivisions 7 and 9), not to be included in the Register while the\nsuspension has effect.\nNote:\nDealing in a biological that is not included in the Register may be a\ncriminal offence or may contravene a civil penalty provision: see",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If a biological is suspended from the Register under section 32FA,\nthe biological is taken, for the purposes of this Act (other than\nsection 32DQ, Division 5, sections 32FB and 32FC and\nDivisions 7 and 9), not to be included in the Register while the\nsuspension has effect.\nNote:\nDealing in a biological that is not included in the Register may be a\ncriminal offence or may contravene a civil penalty provision: see",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32fd-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32fd-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a2d5f0c0c50f79eef3d0f6d304c15f2ca9053c4a1b87a067a6ce345c54b24253",
      "skos:note": "Dealing in a biological not included in the Register may be a criminal offence or contravene a civil penalty provision."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32fd",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32FD Effect of suspension",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 352,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a biological is suspended from the Register under section 32FA,\nthe biological is taken, for the purposes of this Act (other than\nsection 32DQ, Division 5, sections 32FB and 32FC and\nDivisions 7 and 9), not to be included in the Register while the\nsuspension has effect.\nNote:\nDealing in a biological that is not included in the Register may be a\ncriminal offence or may contravene a civil penalty provision: see"
    },
