      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.356",
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, before cancelling the entry of the biological from the\nRegister, the Secretary must:\n(a) inform the person in writing that the Secretary proposes the\ncancellation and set out the reasons for it; and\n(b) invite the person to make written submissions to the\nSecretary in relation to the proposed cancellation within the\nperiod specified in the notice (being not less than 28 days\nafter the day the notice is given).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) However, before cancelling the entry of the biological from the\nRegister, the Secretary must:\n(a) inform the person in writing that the Secretary proposes the\ncancellation and set out the reasons for it; and\n(b) invite the person to make written submissions to the\nSecretary in relation to the proposed cancellation within the\nperiod specified in the notice (being not less than 28 days\nafter the day the notice is given).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32gc"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32gc-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32gc-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32gc-ss-2-logic-epistemic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32gc-ss-2-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32gc-ss-2-logic-argumentation-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32gc-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "328985119a7fcda959f3ba4bfe4a2e74d9e88f4297a6317a8bda16cabf1599e4",
      "skos:note": "Secretary must inform person of proposed cancellation and invite written submissions.",
      "dc:description": "written notice, written submissions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32gc-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32GC(2) Cancellation of biological from the Register after notice of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 356,
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, before cancelling the entry of the biological from the\nRegister, the Secretary must:\n(a) inform the person in writing that the Secretary proposes the\ncancellation and set out the reasons for it; and\n(b) invite the person to make written submissions to the\nSecretary in relation to the proposed cancellation within the\nperiod specified in the notice (being not less than 28 days\nafter the day the notice is given)."
    },
