      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.356",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Secretary must not make a decision relating to the proposed\ncancellation until the Secretary has had regard to any submissions\nthe person makes under paragraph (2)(b).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Secretary must not make a decision relating to the proposed\ncancellation until the Secretary has had regard to any submissions\nthe person makes under paragraph (2)(b).",
      "values:partOf": {
