      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.364",
      "values:originalText": "The Secretary must cause to be published in the Gazette or on the\nDepartment’s website, as soon as practicable after imposing a\nrequirement under section 32HA, a notice setting out particulars of\nthe requirement.",
      "skos:definition": "The Secretary must cause to be published in the Gazette or on the\nDepartment’s website, as soon as practicable after imposing a\nrequirement under section 32HA, a notice setting out particulars of\nthe requirement.",
