    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32je",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32JE Secretary may require information etc. about biologicals",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32je"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.371",
      "values:originalText": "exempt under the regulations\n(1) If a person is exempt under subsection 32CA(1) in relation to a\nbiological, the Secretary may give the person a written notice\nrequiring the person to give to the Secretary specified information,\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "exempt under the regulations\n(1) If a person is exempt under subsection 32CA(1) in relation to a\nbiological, the Secretary may give the person a written notice\nrequiring the person to give to the Secretary specified information,\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32je-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32je-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9c4bcc3c6143357646c6d62fe8052ce1e7559b8b8f0e9e01db059e337b02690e",
      "skos:note": "Secretary may require information about biologicals from exempt persons."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32je",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32JE Secretary may require information etc. about biologicals",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 371,
      "values:originalText": "exempt under the regulations\n(1) If a person is exempt under subsection 32CA(1) in relation to a\nbiological, the Secretary may give the person a written notice\nrequiring the person to give to the Secretary specified information,\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32je-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32je"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32je-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "may",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Implies an obligation.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32jf",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "32JF Secretary may require information etc. about biologicals",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32jf"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.373",
      "values:originalText": "exempt to deal with emergencies\n(1) This section applies to a person who is required to comply with a\ncondition of an exemption of a biological under section 32CB.\n(2) The Secretary may, by written notice given to the person, require\nthe person to give to the Secretary specified information, or to\nproduce to the Secretary specified documents, relating to one or\nmore of the following:\n(a) the supply of the biological;\n(b) the handling of the biological;\n(c) the monitoring of the supply of the biological;\n(d) the results of the supply of the biological;\n(e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of this paragraph in relation to a biological of that\nkind.\n(3) The person must give the information, or produce the documents,\nto the Secretary:\n(a) within the period, of not less than 14 days after the day the\nnotice is given, specified in the notice; and\n(b) in the form specified in the notice.\nNote:\nSection 32JI contains criminal offences for failing to comply with the\nnotice and for giving false or misleading information or documents\nand section 32JJ contains a civil penalty for giving false or misleading\ninformation or documents.\n(4) The form may require or permit the information to be given, or the\ndocuments to be produced, in accordance with specified software\nrequirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "exempt to deal with emergencies\n(1) This section applies to a person who is required to comply with a\ncondition of an exemption of a biological under section 32CB.\n(2) The Secretary may, by written notice given to the person, require\nthe person to give to the Secretary specified information, or to\nproduce to the Secretary specified documents, relating to one or\nmore of the following:\n(a) the supply of the biological;\n(b) the handling of the biological;\n(c) the monitoring of the supply of the biological;\n(d) the results of the supply of the biological;\n(e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of this paragraph in relation to a biological of that\nkind.\n(3) The person must give the information, or produce the documents,\nto the Secretary:\n(a) within the period, of not less than 14 days after the day the\nnotice is given, specified in the notice; and\n(b) in the form specified in the notice.\nNote:\nSection 32JI contains criminal offences for failing to comply with the\nnotice and for giving false or misleading information or documents\nand section 32JJ contains a civil penalty for giving false or misleading\ninformation or documents.\n(4) The form may require or permit the information to be given, or the\ndocuments to be produced, in accordance with specified software\nrequirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32jf-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32jf-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32jf-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-32jf-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "951edf9d3466603b4bbc319403325ec19bcd4ce43be4fededd8adf6fbcd9114e"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-32jf",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "32JF Secretary may require information etc. about biologicals",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 373,
      "values:originalText": "exempt to deal with emergencies\n(1) This section applies to a person who is required to comply with a\ncondition of an exemption of a biological under section 32CB.\n(2) The Secretary may, by written notice given to the person, require\nthe person to give to the Secretary specified information, or to\nproduce to the Secretary specified documents, relating to one or\nmore of the following:\n(a) the supply of the biological;\n(b) the handling of the biological;\n(c) the monitoring of the supply of the biological;\n(d) the results of the supply of the biological;\n(e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of this paragraph in relation to a biological of that\nkind.\n(3) The person must give the information, or produce the documents,\nto the Secretary:\n(a) within the period, of not less than 14 days after the day the\nnotice is given, specified in the notice; and\n(b) in the form specified in the notice.\nNote:\nSection 32JI contains criminal offences for failing to comply with the\nnotice and for giving false or misleading information or documents\nand section 32JJ contains a civil penalty for giving false or misleading\ninformation or documents.\n(4) The form may require or permit the information to be given, or the\ndocuments to be produced, in accordance with specified software\nrequirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
