      "values:originalText": "(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 32JE, 32JF, 32JG\nor 32JH; and\n(b) the person fails to comply with the notice.\nPenalty: 500 penalty units.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 32JE, 32JF, 32JG\nor 32JH; and\n(b) the person fails to comply with the notice.\nPenalty: 500 penalty units.",
      "values:partOf": {
