      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.380",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The regulations may exempt therapeutic goods or a class of\ntherapeutic goods identified in the regulations from the operation\nof this Part.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The regulations may exempt therapeutic goods or a class of\ntherapeutic goods identified in the regulations from the operation\nof this Part.",
