      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.380",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The regulations may exempt a person identified in the regulations\nfrom the operation of this Part in relation to the manufacture or a\nstep in the manufacture of therapeutic goods or a class of\ntherapeutic goods identified in the regulations.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The regulations may exempt a person identified in the regulations\nfrom the operation of this Part in relation to the manufacture or a\nstep in the manufacture of therapeutic goods or a class of\ntherapeutic goods identified in the regulations.",
      "values:partOf": {
