      },
      "cml:premiseText": "A jury may acquit a person of an offence against this subsection and\nmay convict the person of an offence against subsection (4) instead:\nsee section 53A.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The court has discretion to acquit or convict a person of an offence."
    },
