      "cml:premiseText": "(5) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person holds a licence; and\n(b) the person does an act or omits to do an act; and\n(c) the act or omission breaches a condition of the licence.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The licence breach occurs during the licence period."
    },
    {
