    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-37-ss-1b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "37(1B) Application for licence",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-37-ss-1b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.386",
      "values:originalText": "(1B) If an applicant is of the view that, having regard to the guidelines\nunder section 38A, a licence could be granted covering 2 or more\nmanufacturing sites, the applicant may:\n(a) identify those sites in the application; and\n(b) state the applicant’s reasons for the applicant’s view.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(1B) If an applicant is of the view that, having regard to the guidelines\nunder section 38A, a licence could be granted covering 2 or more\nmanufacturing sites, the applicant may:\n(a) identify those sites in the application; and\n(b) state the applicant’s reasons for the applicant’s view.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-37"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-37-ss-1b-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "05346525101c5634d6cd94847acc9cbfdb381de12153f5717d2c5c790bcac7a9",
      "skos:note": "Applicant may identify multiple manufacturing sites in application."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-37-ss-1b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "37(1B) Application for licence",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 386,
      "values:originalText": "(1B) If an applicant is of the view that, having regard to the guidelines\nunder section 38A, a licence could be granted covering 2 or more\nmanufacturing sites, the applicant may:\n(a) identify those sites in the application; and\n(b) state the applicant’s reasons for the applicant’s view.\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices"
    },
