    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-39",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "39 Term of licence",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-39"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.394",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A licence commences on the day specified in the licence and\nremains in force until it is revoked or suspended.\n(2) If:\n(a) the licence covers therapeutic goods that are exempt under\nsection 18A; and\n(b) those goods cease to be exempt under that section before the\nlicence is revoked;\nthe licence ceases to be in force in relation to those goods when\nthose goods cease to be exempt under that section.\nNote:\nAn exemption under section 18A may cease to have effect only in\nrelation to some of the goods covered by the exemption, see\nsubsection 18A(5).\n(3) If:\n(a) the licence covers a biological that is exempt under\nsection 32CB; and\n(b) the biological ceases to be exempt under that section before\nthe licence is revoked;\nthe licence ceases to be in force in relation to the biological when\nthe biological ceases to be exempt under that section.\nNote:\nAn exemption under section 32CB may cease to have effect only in\nrelation to some of the biologicals covered by the exemption: see\nsubsections 32CB(5) and 32CD(1).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A licence commences on the day specified in the licence and\nremains in force until it is revoked or suspended.\n(2) If:\n(a) the licence covers therapeutic goods that are exempt under\nsection 18A; and\n(b) those goods cease to be exempt under that section before the\nlicence is revoked;\nthe licence ceases to be in force in relation to those goods when\nthose goods cease to be exempt under that section.\nNote:\nAn exemption under section 18A may cease to have effect only in\nrelation to some of the goods covered by the exemption, see\nsubsection 18A(5).\n(3) If:\n(a) the licence covers a biological that is exempt under\nsection 32CB; and\n(b) the biological ceases to be exempt under that section before\nthe licence is revoked;\nthe licence ceases to be in force in relation to the biological when\nthe biological ceases to be exempt under that section.\nNote:\nAn exemption under section 32CB may cease to have effect only in\nrelation to some of the biologicals covered by the exemption: see\nsubsections 32CB(5) and 32CD(1).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-39-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-39-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-39-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c49f966472fae46b958b98656afa786943d9eac4d16f4e8d8fa9e8e3202d04af"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-39",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "39 Term of licence",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 394,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A licence commences on the day specified in the licence and\nremains in force until it is revoked or suspended.\n(2) If:\n(a) the licence covers therapeutic goods that are exempt under\nsection 18A; and\n(b) those goods cease to be exempt under that section before the\nlicence is revoked;\nthe licence ceases to be in force in relation to those goods when\nthose goods cease to be exempt under that section.\nNote:\nAn exemption under section 18A may cease to have effect only in\nrelation to some of the goods covered by the exemption, see\nsubsection 18A(5).\n(3) If:\n(a) the licence covers a biological that is exempt under\nsection 32CB; and\n(b) the biological ceases to be exempt under that section before\nthe licence is revoked;\nthe licence ceases to be in force in relation to the biological when\nthe biological ceases to be exempt under that section.\nNote:\nAn exemption under section 32CB may cease to have effect only in\nrelation to some of the biologicals covered by the exemption: see\nsubsections 32CB(5) and 32CD(1)."
    },
