    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-40-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40(4) Conditions of licences",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-40-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.394",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In addition to any conditions imposed under subsection (1) or (2),\neach licence is, except as otherwise specified in the licence, subject\nto the conditions that the holder of the licence will:\n(a) ensure that:\n(i) the goods conform to any standard applicable to the\ngoods; and\n(ii) the holder of the licence observes the manufacturing\nprinciples in carrying out any steps in the manufacture\nof the goods under the licence;\nunless:\n(iii) the goods are a biological and are for supply after the\ncircumstances prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of paragraphs 14(9A)(b) and 14A(2A)(b) have\noccurred; or\n(iv) the goods are a biological and are for export after the\ncircumstances prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of paragraphs 14(13A)(b) and 14A(3A)(b)\nhave occurred; and\n(aa) if:\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In addition to any conditions imposed under subsection (1) or (2),\neach licence is, except as otherwise specified in the licence, subject\nto the conditions that the holder of the licence will:\n(a) ensure that:\n(i) the goods conform to any standard applicable to the\ngoods; and\n(ii) the holder of the licence observes the manufacturing\nprinciples in carrying out any steps in the manufacture\nof the goods under the licence;\nunless:\n(iii) the goods are a biological and are for supply after the\ncircumstances prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of paragraphs 14(9A)(b) and 14A(2A)(b) have\noccurred; or\n(iv) the goods are a biological and are for export after the\ncircumstances prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of paragraphs 14(13A)(b) and 14A(3A)(b)\nhave occurred; and\n(aa) if:\n\nChapter 3  Medicines and other therapeutic goods that are not medical devices",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-40"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-40-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-40-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-40-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-40-ss-4-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-40-ss-4-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-40-ss-4-logic-cogai-5"
        }
