      "values:originalText": "(8) If an application is made under subsection (6) and any applicable\nprescribed inspection fees have been paid, the Secretary may, by\nnotice in writing given to the holder of the licence, vary the\nmanufacturing site authorisation.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) If an application is made under subsection (6) and any applicable\nprescribed inspection fees have been paid, the Secretary may, by\nnotice in writing given to the holder of the licence, vary the\nmanufacturing site authorisation.",
